t_zs.zg:.2f}]')\nif state.divergence:\n    print(f'⚠️ 背驰: {state.divergence}')\nprint(f'详情: {state.detail}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"sdk version\" | grep -v \"Grab quote\" | grep -v \"小米模拟\" | grep -v \"当前持仓\" | grep -v \"累计盈亏\" | grep -v \"^\\[\" | grep -v \"^$\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":137,"output":674,"cacheRead":47680,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48491,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779750689572}}
