{"type":"message","id":"77e9cee0","parentId":"d6865928","timestamp":"2026-05-26T04:14:30.390Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is referring to the original questions that triggered the upgrade:\n\n1. 是对哪个级别的观察 - What level is being observed?\n2. 智能级别v2.0有没有接入 - Is v2.0 integrated?\n3. 有没有预交易级别 - Is there a pre-trading level?\n4. 该级别最近一次买/卖点 - Latest buy/sell point at that level?\n5. 空单还是多单 - Long or short?\n6. 进场与出场预案 - Entry and exit plans?\n\nI already answered #1-3 and #6 during the upgrade. But VAN wants a complete answer now with all the specific parameters. Let me give a concrete, data-driven answer using the actual analysis results.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"🦞 **Captain，逐条回答：**\n\n---\n\n## 1️⃣ 对哪个级别的观察？\n\n**当前观察级别：日线**\n- 结构状态：`turning`（转折）\n- 中枢：[31.20, 32.94]\n- 最后一笔：向上，H:32.88 L:28.80\n- 趋势强度：0%\n- 背驰：`shock_exhaustion`（盘整力度衰减），置信度 60%\n- 流畅度：0%（数据不足）\n\n## 2️⃣ 智能级别 v2.0 有没有接入？\n\n**✅ 已接入**，刚才升级完成。现在用 `get_structure_state()` 驱动，不再是旧 API。\n\n## 3️⃣ 有没有预交易级别？\n\n**✅ 有**，`--pre-scan` 命令输出：\n\n| 参数 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| 策略 | `reversal_ready`（转折准备） |\n| 共振级别 | 0级（日线无方向，不共振） |\n| 方向 | neutral |\n| 仓位 | 0%（不满足开仓条件） |\n\n## 4️⃣ 该级别最近一次买卖点？\n\n**日线无买卖点**。背驰检测到 `shock_exhaustion`（盘整力度衰减 60%），但未触发正式买卖点信号（需要趋势末端背驰 + 方向确认）。\n\n## 5️⃣ 空单还是多单？\n\n**当前：无持仓，无信号。**\n\n- 日线转折但方向不明确（`trend_direction: None`）\n- 共振 0 级 → 不满足开仓条件\n- 如果价格突破中枢上沿 32.94 → 可能做多\n- 如果价格跌破中枢下沿 31.20 → 可能做空\n\n## 6️⃣ 进场与出场预案？\n\n**进场预案**（满足条件才触发）：\n- 条件：日线方向确认 + 30分钟买点 + 共振≥2级\n- 仓位：20%\n- 触发价：待确认\n\n**出场预案**（已有）：\n- 止损：33.60（中枢上沿 32.94 × 1.02）\n- 止盈：31.20（中枢下沿）\n- 移动止损：盈利 3% 后止损移到入场价\n\n---\n\n**总结：日线转折中，但方向未确认，共振 0 级，无信号，不交易。等方向。**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":755,"output":916,"cacheRead":96064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97735,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779768853920}}
{"type":"message","id":"9e1a8225","parentId":"77e9cee0","timestamp":"2026-05-26T04:18:47.738Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e65bca038acc22e4d97a8859d1\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 12:18 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e65bca038acc22e4d97a8859d1]\nVAN: czsc 没给出最近的买，点或卖点吗。你的当下必然处于所观察级别的最后个一买点或买点之后啊"}],"timestamp":1779769127726}}
{"type":"message","id":"21e51f82","parentId":"9e1a8225","timestamp":"2026-05-26T04:19:03.086Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is making a very important point. In Chanlun (缠论), the current price is always AFTER some buy or sell point. The system should be able to identify:\n\n1. The most recent buy/sell point on the daily chart\n2. Where the current price is relative to that point\n3. What phase we're in (after buy1, after buy2, after sell1, etc.)\n\nThe czsc_extension has `detect_buy_sell_points()` method that should return these. Let me check why it's returning empty results, and also analyze the bi_list more carefully to understand the current position.\n\nLet me run a more detailed analysis to find the historical buy/sell points.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain 说得对，缠论里当下必然处于某个买卖点之后。让我深入分析——"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_504a99c9bca04cd188ab775c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent && python3 -c \"\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'paper-trading')\nfrom xiaomi_paper_trader import XiaomiPaperTrader\nfrom czsc_extension import CzscExtension\nfrom czsc import CZSC, Freq, format_standard_kline\nfrom datetime import datetime\nimport pandas as pd\nt = XiaomiPaperTrader()\n\n# 获取日线数据\nbars = t.quote_client.get_bars(['01810'], period='day', begin_time='2026-01-01', end_time='2026-05-26')\nbars['dt'] = bars['time'].apply(lambda x: datetime.fromtimestamp(x/1000))\nbars['symbol'] = '01810'\nbars['vol'] = bars['volume']\nbars['amount'] = bars.get('amount', bars['vol'] * bars['close'])\n\nformatted = format_standard_kline(bars, freq=Freq.D)\nczsc_obj = CZSC(formatted)\next = CzscExtension(czsc_obj, symbol='01810', timeframe='daily')\n\nprint('=== 笔序列 (全部) ===')\nfor i, bi in enumerate(czsc_obj.bi_list):\n    direction = '↑' if bi.direction.value == 'up' else '↓'\n    print(f'  [{i}] {direction} {bi.fx_a.fx:.2f} -> {bi.fx_b.fx:.2f}  ({bi.sdt.strftime(\\\"%m-%d\\\")} ~ {bi.edt.strftime(\\\"%m-%d\\\")})')\n\nprint(f'\\\\n=== 中枢序列 ===')\nzs_list = ext.calc_zs_list()\nfor zs in zs_list:\n    print(f'  ZS[{zs.index}] [{zs.zd:.2f}, {zs.zg:.2f}] gg={zs.gg:.2f} dd={zs.dd:.2f} 笔索引={zs.bi_indices}')\n\nprint(f'\\\\n=== 买卖点检测 ===')\nbsp = ext.detect_buy_sell_points()\nif bsp:\n    for p in bsp:\n        print(f'  {p.type} @ {p.price:.2f} direction={p.direction} confidence={p.confidence:.2f} bi_index={p.bi_index}')\nelse:\n    print('  无买卖点')\n\nprint(f'\\\\n=== 背驰检测 ===')\ndiv = ext._detect_divergence_enhanced(czsc_obj.bi_list)\nprint(f'  detected: {div.get(\\\"detected\\\")}')\nprint(f'  type: {div.get(\\\"type\\\")}')\nprint(f'  confidence: {div.get(\\\"confidence\\\")}')\nprint(f'  detail: {div.get(\\\"detail\\\")}')\n\nprint(f'\\\\n=== 结构状态 ===')\nstate = ext.get_structure_state()\nprint(f'  state: {state.state}')\nprint(f'  direction: {state.trend_direction}')\nprint(f'  zs_movement: {state.zs_movement}')\nprint(f'  detail: {state.detail}')\n\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"sdk version\" | grep -v \"Grab quote\" | grep -v \"小米模拟\" | grep -v \"当前持仓\" | grep -v \"累计盈亏\" | grep -v \"^\\[\" | grep -v \"^$\"","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1109,"output":1044,"cacheRead":96768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98921,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779769127734}}
