{"type":"message","id":"16d2752f","parentId":"e57fe0b5","timestamp":"2026-05-26T04:23:19.114Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the complete picture with the fix applied. Let me give VAN a comprehensive, data-driven report.\n\nKey findings with the fix:\n1. **结构状态**: trending (趋势), down direction\n2. **趋势强度**: 46%\n3. **中枢运动**: down (中枢下移 -11.8%)\n4. **背驰**: detected=False (无背驰)\n5. **买卖点**: shock_sell @ 32.88 (中枢震荡卖点)\n6. **最后中枢**: [30.44, 32.88], dd=28.80\n\n\n7. **最后笔**: 向上 28.80→32.88\n8. **流畅度**: 46% (不流畅)\n9. **回调深度**: 142.1% (回调太深)\n10. **方向一致**: 50%\n\nThe structure shows a downtrend with the latest completed bullish leg pulling back significantly at 142.1%, which is quite deep. I'm now positioned after that upward move from 28.80 to 32.88, with the last pivot low at 28.80 and the central pivot zone at [30.44, 32.88].\n\nThe shock_sell signal at 32.88 marks the most recent sell point, while the previous buy signal occurred at 28.80 on 04-30. The key question is whether this pullback holds above 28.80 to form a higher low (second buy opportunity) or breaks below it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"🦞 **Captain，Bug修复后完整分析：**\n\n---\n\n## 📍 当前所处位置\n\n| 参数 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| **一买** | $28.80 (04-30) 底背驰：新低+力度比0.61 |\n| **一卖** | $32.88 (05-14) 中枢震荡卖点 |\n| **当前价** | $30.16（从一卖回落） |\n| **结构状态** | `trending` down，强度 46% |\n| **中枢** | [30.44, 32.88]，中枢下移 -11.8% |\n| **最后笔** | ↑ 28.80→32.88（向上笔已完成） |\n| **流畅度** | 46%（不流畅，回调深度142%） |\n\n## 🎯 当前等待：二买\n\n- 价格从一买$28.80涨到一卖$32.88，现在回落到$30.16\n- **二买条件**：回调不破$28.80 + 底分型确认\n- **当前位置**：中枢[30.44, 32.88]内，回落66.7%\n- **如果破$28.80**：检查力度，力度减弱=类二买，力度增强=趋势延续\n\n## 📊 最近买卖点序列\n\n```\n一买 $28.80 (04-30) → 一卖 $32.88 (05-14) → 当前 $30.16 (等待二买)\n```\n\n## ❌ 已修复Bug\n\n`czsc_extension.py` 所有 `direction == 'up'` 改为 `direction == Direction.Up`，买卖点检测现在正常工作。\n\n---\n\n**总结：一买→一卖完成，当前从一卖回落，等待二买确认。不破$28.80则二买有效。**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaom