{"type":"compaction","id":"c2997cee","parentId":"16d2752f","timestamp":"2026-05-26T04:23:48.491Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. Prepare for and monitor Hong Kong stock market (HK) Asian trading session, specifically Xiaomi 01810\n2. Upgrade `xiaomi_paper_trader.py` to integrate intelligent level v2.0 (智能级别确立 v2.0) with multi-level resonance, pre-trade scanning, and structured entry/exit plans\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Max single trade loss: 2% (default) / 3% (current code uses 3%)\n- VAN prefers VAN's core principle: \"凡强趋必然浅回调，不论多空\" (strong trends always have shallow pullbacks)\n- Smooth fluent trends = small timeframe level = main target\n- System must use StructureState-driven level selection: trending→lock level, ranging→enlarge/avoid, turning→shrink for precision entry\n- Trading assistant persona: 🦞 Trading Assistant\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Session startup, memory restore from 2026-05-25 and 2026-05-26\n- [x] Pre-market analysis of Xiaomi 01810: daily=turning (shock_exhaustion divergence 60%), ZS [31.20,32.94], price 30.00 below ZS\n- [x] 30-min analysis: unknown state, ZS [30.14,30.60], no divergence\n- [x] Launched `xiaomi_paper_trader.py --monitor` (background process, running since 09:01)\n- [x] Monitored Xiaomi through morning session: $30.02→$29.72→$30.36 (oscillating, no signals)\n- [x] Multiple auto-memory updates (08:00, 09:00, 10:00, 11:00, 12:00)\n- [x] Multiple session archives (07to08, 07to10, 10to12)\n- [x] Backup sync to ai-trading-sync (commit c14f881)\n- [x] Identified gap: current `xiaomi_paper_trader.py` uses OLD czsc API, NOT v2.0 StructureState\n- [x] Backed up original: `xiaomi_paper_trader.py.bak_v1`\n- [x] Read full `czsc_extension.py` (v2.0 API with StructureState, get_structure_state(), etc.)\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] **Rewriting `xiaomi_paper_trader.py`** to integrate v2.0 intelligent level system — VAN said \"马上\" (do it now), backup done, full czsc_extension.py read, but the actual rewrite has NOT started yet\n\n### Blocked\n- Monitor process (PID 215002, session glow-haven) is running old code in background — needs restart after upgrade\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Upgrade xiaomi_paper_trader.py**: VAN confirmed \"马上\" to upgrade; old code uses `ext.bi_list`, `ext.calc_zs_list()`, `ext.detect_divergence()` — needs to use `ext.get_structure_state()` returning StructureState\n- **Not entering Xiaomi now**: Price 30.00 below daily ZS [31.20, 32.94], wait for price to break above 31.20 or 30-min bottom divergence confirmation\n- **Archive automation**: 3 cron jobs running (hourly memory, 2hr session archive, daily memory archive)\n\n## Next Steps\n1. **Rewrite `xiaomi_paper_trader.py`** with these upgrades:\n   - Replace old `analyze_signal()` to use `CzscExtension.get_structure_state()` (returns `StructureState` with `.state`, `.trend_direction`, `.strength`)\n   - Add multi-level resonance: daily direction → 30min structure → 5min entry\n   - Add `pre_trade_scan()` — run before market open to determine today's strategy (trend_follow/ranging_wait/reversal_prepare)\n   - Add structured entry plan: buy1 probe / buy2 add / quasi-buy2 confirm\n   - Add structured exit plan: ZS upper edge take-profit / below ZS stop-loss / trailing stop\n   - Add trend fluency analysis via `calc_trend_fluency()`\n2. Stop old monitor process (PID 215002) and restart with new code\n3. Test the upgraded system on afternoon session (HK 午市 13:00-16:00)\n4. Update memory with upgrade completion\n\n## Critical Context\n- **Files**:\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py` — main file to rewrite\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py.bak_v1` — backup of v1\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py` — v2.0 API (StructureState, CzscExtension)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/hk_a_plan.md` — HK trading plan with rules\n- **v2.0 API key patterns**:\n  - `ext = CzscExtension(czsc_obj, symbol='01810', timeframe='daily')`\n  - `state = ext.get_structure_state()` (takes NO args, only self)\n  - `state.state` → 'trending'/'ranging'/'turning'/'unknown'\n  - `state.should_follow_trend()` / `state.should_wait_breakout()` / `state.should_catch_reversal()`\n  - BI attributes: `bi.fx_a.fx`, `bi.fx_b.fx`, `bi.high`, `bi.low`, `bi.power`, `bi.direction.value` ('up'/'down')\n  - CZSC init: `CZSC(formatted_bars)` (no freq kwarg); use `format_standard_kline(df, freq=Freq.D)`\n  - Freq enum: `Freq.D`, `Freq.F30`, `Freq.F5` (NOT `Freq.M30`)\n- **Tiger SDK**: `get_briefs(['01810'])` returns list of QuoteBrief objects (not iterable single); use `quote_client.get_bars()` for historical data\n- **Monitor log**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_trader.log`\n- **Memory files**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-26.md`\n- **Current Xiaomi price**: ~$30.28-30.36 (last check 12:00), daily ZS [31.20, 32.94], 30min ZS [30.14, 30.60]\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nVAN replied to a previous question asking about trading observation levels — specifically which level is being observed, whether \"智能级别v2.0\" (Smart Level v2.0) has been connected/integrated, whether there is a pre-trading level, and details about the most recent buy/sell points (short or long), along with entry and exit plans.\n\n## Early Progress\n- VAN's reply message content appears to be empty or was truncated — no substantive response was captured in this prefix.\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- This is a trading-focused conversation involving technical analysis of trading levels (级别), with references to an AI-powered trading system called \"智能级别v2.0\" (Smart Level v2.0).\n- Key concepts: observation levels, pre-trading levels (预交易级别), buy/sell signals, long/short positions (多单/空单), and entry/exit strategies (进场/出场预案).\n- The retained suffix likely contains VAN's actual trading analysis or response about specific market observations.","firstKeptEntryId":"c6d80532","tokensBefore":118866,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":false}
