{"type":"message","id":"8dc83fb7","parentId":"f49f0f3a","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:47:39.289Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The issue is that with only 90 days of data, we only get 5 bi and 1 zhongshu. The analysis shows `turning` instead of `trending down`. But with data from January (which I used earlier), we had 9 bi and 2 zhongshu, which showed `trending down`.\n\nThe problem is that 90 days of data doesn't go back far enough. Let me increase the data range for daily analysis.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"问题找到了：90天数据只产生5笔1中枢，无法判断趋势。需要更多数据。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_656be1f6618544a897a91a3b","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py","new_string":"        # 获取数据（日线需要更长历史以获得足够笔和中枢）\n        df_daily = self._fetch_bars('day', days=180)\n        df_30m = self._fetch_bars('30min', days=15)\n        df_5m = self._fetch_bars('5min', days=5)","old_string":"        # 获取数据\n        df_daily = self._fetch_bars('day', days=90)\n        df_30m = self._fetch_bars('30min', days=15)\n        df_5m = self._fetch_bars('5min', days=5)"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1524,"output":416,"cacheRead":101248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103188,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779774447881}}
