{"type":"message","id":"bc0c95cf","parentId":"76cf7393","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:48:44.272Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8f524190a1424d718c3c6cc4","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                best_point = max(sell_points_30, key=lambda x: x.get('confidence', 0))\n                source = '30min'\n\n            # 再找日线卖点（顺势卖点）\n            if not best_point:\n                sell_points_d = [b for b in daily_bsp if 'sell' in b.get('type', '')]\n                if sell_points_d:\n                    best_point = max(sell_points_d, key=lambda x: x.get('confidence', 0))\n                    source = 'daily'\n\n            action = 'SELL'  # 做空 = SELL\n\n        # ---- 上升趋势：找买点做多 ----\n        elif direction == 'long' and strategy == 'trend_follow_long':\n            buy_points_30 = [b for b in min30_bsp if 'buy' in b.get('type', '')]\n            if buy_points_30:\n                best_point = max(buy_points_30, key=lambda x: x.get('confidence', 0))\n                source = '30min'\n\n            if not best_point:\n                buy_points_d = [b for b in daily_bsp if 'buy' in b.get('type', '')]\n                if buy_points_d:\n                    best_point = max(buy_points_d, key=lambda x: x.get('confidence', 0))\n                    source = 'daily'\n\n            action = 'BUY'\n\n        if not best_point:\n            return None\n\n        # 仓位计算\n        account_value = self.get_account_value()\n        entry_pct = analysis.entry_plan.get('position_pct', 0.2)\n        position_value = account_value * entry_pct\n        current_price = analysis.daily.get('last_bi', {}).get('high', 0) or 30.0\n        quantity = int(position_value / current_price / 100) * 100  # 港股100股一手\n\n        if quantity <= 0:\n            return None\n\n        # 出场参数\n        stop_loss = analysis.exit_plan.get('stop_loss', current_price * 0.97)\n        take_profit = analysis.exit_plan.get('take_profit', current_price * 1.05)\n\n        return TradeSignal(\n            action=action,\n            direction=direction,\n            signal_type=best_point['type'],\n            price=best_point.get('price', current_price),\n            stop_loss=stop_loss,\n            take_profit=take_profit,\n            quantity=quantity,\n            confidence=best_point.get('confidence', 0.6),\n            resonance_level=analysis.resonance_level,\n            entry_plan=analysis.entry_plan,\n            exit_plan=analysis.exit_plan,\n            detail=f\"{source} {best_point['type']} | 共振{analysis.resonance_level}级 | {strategy} | {direction}\"\n        )\n\n    # ============ 实时监控 ============\n\n[207 more lines in file. Use offset=630 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779774524269}}
{"type":"message","id":"8cdfd8bf","parentId":"bc0c95cf","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:48:58.159Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see the issue! The code looks correct - it should find the sell point. But there's a problem with the `entry_pct`:\n\n```python\nentry_pct = analysis.entry_plan.get('position_pct', 0.2)\n```\n\nAnd in the `_build_entry_plan` for `trend_follow_short`:\n```python\nif strategy == 'trend_follow_short':\n    # 找30分钟卖点（反弹到中枢上沿+顶背驰）\n    if min30:\n        bsp = min30.get('buy_sell_points', [])\n        sell_points = [b for b in bsp if 'sell' in b.get('type', '')]\n\n\n```\n\nWhen there are no 30-minute sell signals, the position percentage gets set to 0, which cascades through the calculation and causes the quantity to be 0 as well, preventing any trade signal from being generated. The fix is to either fall back to a default position size when the 30-minute sell points aren't available, or to allow the daily sell signal to trigger with a reasonable default percentage.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到问题了：30分钟没有卖点时 `position_pct` 设为0，导致信号被跳过。修复——"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9fc8762444af45cf862d3ddf","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py","new_string":"        # ---- 顺势做空（下跌趋势） ----\n        if strategy == 'trend_follow_short':\n            # 找30分钟卖点（反弹到中枢上沿+顶背驰）\n            if min30:\n                bsp = min30.get('buy_sell_points', [])\n                sell_points = [b for b in bsp if 'sell' in b.get('type', '')]\n                if sell_points:\n                    best = max(sell_points, key=lambda x: x.get('confidence', 0))\n                    plan['trigger_price'] = best.get('price')\n                    plan['conditions'].append(f\"30m卖点: {best['type']} @ {best['price']:.2f}\")\n                    plan['position_pct'] = 0.3\n                    plan['note'] = f\"顺势做空: 30分钟{best['type']}确认\"\n                else:\n                    plan['note'] = '下跌趋势中，等待30分钟卖点'\n                    plan['position_pct'] = 0.2  # 默认仓位，日线卖点可触发\n            else:\n                plan['note'] = '下跌趋势中，无30分钟数据'\n                plan['position_pct'] = 0.2","old_string":"        # ---- 顺势做空（下跌趋势） ----\n        if strategy == 'trend_follow_short':\n            # 找30分钟卖点（反弹到中枢上沿+顶背驰）\n            if min30:\n                bsp = min30.get('buy_sell_points', [])\n                sell_points = [b for b in bsp if 'sell' in b.get('type', '')]\n                if sell_points:\n                    best = max(sell_points, key=lambda x: x.get('confidence', 0))\n                    plan['trigger_price'] = best.get('price')\n                    plan['conditions'].append(f\"30m卖点: {best['type']} @ {best['price']:.2f}\")\n                    plan['position_pct'] = 0.3\n                    plan['note'] = f\"顺势做空: 30分钟{best['type']}确认\"\n                else:\n                    plan['note'] = '下跌趋势中，等待30分钟卖点'\n                    plan['position_pct'] = 0"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":755,"output":1018,"cacheRead":107904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109677,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779774524274}}
