{"type":"message","id":"6c010597","parentId":"6a515290","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:49:19.949Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3ac328b7c77445caaeab359f","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   🎯 策略:trend_follow_short 方向:short 共振:2级\n   📈 30m: trending 中枢[30.14,30.60] 5m: unknown\n2026-05-26 13:49:15,014 [INFO] \n🎯 发现交易信号! daily shock_sell | 共振2级 | trend_follow_short | short\n2026-05-26 13:49:15,014 [INFO] \n==================================================\n2026-05-26 13:49:15,014 [INFO] 💰 执行交易: SELL short\n2026-05-26 13:49:15,014 [INFO]    类型: shock_sell\n2026-05-26 13:49:15,014 [INFO]    价格: $32.88\n2026-05-26 13:49:15,014 [INFO]    数量: 6000\n2026-05-26 13:49:15,014 [INFO]    止损: $33.54\n2026-05-26 13:49:15,014 [INFO]    止盈: $30.44\n2026-05-26 13:49:15,014 [INFO]    共振: 2级\n2026-05-26 13:49:15,014 [INFO] ==================================================\n2026-05-26 13:49:15,014 [INFO] ✅ 交易执行完成（模拟）"}],"details":{"status":"running","sessionId":"glow-forest","total":78,"totalLines":78,"totalChars":3735,"truncated":false,"name":"cd /workspace/projects/wo...un-agent/paper-trading"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779774559947}}
{"type":"message","id":"9fe64fed","parentId":"6c010597","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:49:34.215Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The monitor is running and has already executed a trade signal:\n- SELL short @ $32.88\n- 止损: $33.54\n- 止盈: $30.44\n- 数量: 6000\n- 共振: 2级\n\nThis is the correct behavior - the system is now following the trend direction (down) and looking for sell opportunities.\n\nLet me update the memory and give VAN a summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ **v2.1 监控已启动，顺势做空信号已触发：**\n\n```\n💰 执行交易: SELL short\n   类型: shock_sell\n   价格: $32.88\n   数量: 6000\n   止损: $33.54\n   止盈: $30.44\n   共振: 2级\n```\n\n**改造完成总结：**\n\n| 改造项 | 旧逻辑 | 新逻辑 |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| 分析顺序 | 先找买卖点→判断方向 | **先定趋势→再找机会** |\n| 策略 | 所有机会都找买点 | **下跌找卖点，上涨找买点** |\n| 信号生成 | 只生成BUY | **SELL(做空) / BUY(做多)** |\n| 数据范围 | 90天(5笔1中枢) | **180天(9笔2中枢)** |\n| 报告格式 | 模板式 | **趋势方向先行+具体参数** |"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_73a5ab621ec647a68051b345","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-26.md << 'EOF'\n\n### 🔧 监控系统 v2.1 改造完成 (13:49)\n\n**核心改造**: 大级别定方向，小级别找机会。顺势而为。\n\n**改动内容**:\n1. `_determine_strategy()` — 新增 `trend_follow_short`/`trend_follow_long` 顺势策略\n2. `_build_entry_plan()` — 下跌趋势找卖点做空，上升趋势找买点做多\n3. `_generate_signal()` — 生成SELL(做空)/BUY(做多)信号\n4. 数据范围: 日线90天→180天（获得足够笔和中枢）\n5. 报告格式: 趋势方向先行+具体参数\n\n**首次做空信号**:\n- SELL short @ $32.88 (shock_sell)\n- 止损: $33.54 (中枢上沿32.88×1.02)\n- 止盈: $30.44 (中枢下沿)\n- 数量: 6000\n- 共振: 2级（日线+30分钟同方向）\n\n**VAN教导**: \"关键要对齐认知思维，才能在今后的自主交易实盘中正确的决策\"\nEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":533,"output":762,"cacheRead":111488,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":112783,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779774559952}}
