{"type":"message","id":"dd5cb116","parentId":"f1927850","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:49:39.830Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me also update MEMORY.md with this key change.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_add0a0caf7304703a8e2be62","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /workspace/projects/workspace/MEMORY.md << 'EOF'\n\n### 2026-05-26 - 监控系统 v2.1 顺势改造\n- **核心改造**: 大级别定方向，小级别找机会。下跌找卖点做空，上涨找买点做多\n- **新增策略**: trend_follow_short（顺势做空）/ trend_follow_long（顺势做多）\n- **数据范围**: 日线180天（9笔2中枢，足够判断趋势）\n- **首次做空信号**: SELL short @ $32.88, 止损$33.54, 止盈$30.44, 共振2级\n- **关键修复**: 90天数据不足→180天；position_pct=0导致信号丢失→默认0.2\nEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":698,"output":231,"cacheRead":112000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":112929,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779774574229}}
