{"type":"message","id":"1e717e70","parentId":"f06d64e5","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:56:39.898Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d921acfce3eb4cac82cf70e3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"            'stop_loss': None,\n            'take_profit': None,\n            'trailing_stop': None,\n            'exit_conditions': [],\n            'note': ''\n        }\n\n        last_zs = daily.get('last_zs')\n        if not last_zs:\n            plan['note'] = '无中枢数据'\n            return plan\n\n        zs_zg = last_zs.get('zg', 0)\n        zs_zd = last_zs.get('zd', 0)\n\n        if direction == 'long':\n            # 做多止损：中枢下沿下方2%\n            plan['stop_loss'] = zs_zd * 0.98\n            # 做多止盈：中枢上沿\n            plan['take_profit'] = zs_zg\n            # 移动止损：盈利3%后上移到入场价\n            plan['trailing_stop'] = 'profit_3pct_move_to_entry'\n            plan['exit_conditions'] = [\n                f\"止损: 跌破 {plan['stop_loss']:.2f} (中枢下沿{zs_zd:.2f}×0.98)\",\n                f\"止盈: 到达 {plan['take_profit']:.2f} (中枢上沿)\",\n                \"移动止损: 盈利3%后止损移到入场价\",\n                \"结构止损: 30分钟出现卖点\"\n            ]\n        else:\n            # 做空止损：中枢上沿上方2%\n            plan['stop_loss'] = zs_zg * 1.02\n            # 做空止盈：中枢下沿\n            plan['take_profit'] = zs_zd\n            plan['exit_conditions'] = [\n                f\"止损: 突破 {plan['stop_loss']:.2f} (中枢上沿{zs_zg:.2f}×1.02)\",\n                f\"止盈: 到达 {plan['take_profit']:.2f} (中枢下沿)\",\n                \"移动止损: 盈利3%后止损移到入场价\"\n            ]\n\n        return plan\n\n    # ============ 预交易扫描 ============\n\n    def pre_scan(self) -> Optional[TradeSignal]:\n        \"\"\"\n        盘前扫描 — 确定今日策略\n\n        输出：\n        1. 今日策略（趋势跟随/盘整等待/转折准备）\n        2. 共振级别\n\n[390 more lines in file. Use offset=450 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779774999896}}
{"type":"message","id":"e1b2b9d0","parentId":"1e717e70","timestamp":"2026-05-26T05:56:50.015Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the current logic. Let me explain it to VAN clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"当前止损止盈逻辑：\n\n**做空（当前信号 SELL @ $32.88）**：\n- **止损**: 中枢上沿 × 1.02 = $32.88 × 1.02 = **$33.54**\n- **止盈**: 中枢下沿 = **$30.44**\n- **移动止损**: 盈利3%后止损移到入场价\n\n**做多**：\n- **止损**: 中枢下沿 × 0.98\n- **止盈**: 中枢上沿\n- **移动止损**: 盈利3%后止损移到入场价\n\n---\n\n**问题**：当前逻辑比较简单，止损止盈都是固定百分比，没有考虑结构变化。\n\n比如：\n- 做空止损$33.54，但如果价格回到中枢上沿$32.88附近就该止损了（中枢上沿是关键阻力）\n- 做空止盈$30.44是中枢下沿，但如果趋势延续，应该继续持有\n\nCaptain，需要调整止损止盈逻辑吗？比如：\n1. **止损**: 用中枢上沿作为止损（不加2%缓冲）\n2. **止盈**: 用中枢下沿作为第一目标，突破后用移动止损跟随\n3. **结构止损**: 30分钟出现反向信号时止损"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":652,"output":330,"cacheRead":63168,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64150,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779774999899}}
