{"type":"message","id":"990c128e","parentId":"88338d43","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:06:04.864Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e67ca633ca4c27703f654e39cc\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6e672ce5f8b8b3261bc723d3001\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 14:06 GMT+8\",\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"当前止损止盈逻辑：\\n做空（当前信号 SELL @ $32.88）：\\n\\\\- 止损: 中枢上沿 × 1.02 = $32.88 × 1.02 = $33.54\\n\\\\- 止盈: 中枢下沿 = $30.44\\n\\\\- 移动止损: 盈利3%后止损移到入场价\\n做多：\\n\\\\- 止损: 中枢下沿 × 0.98\\n\\\\- 止盈: 中枢上沿\\n\\\\- 移动止损: 盈利3%后止损移到入场价\\n\\n\\n---\\n\\n\\n问题：当前逻辑比较简单，止损止盈都是固定百分比，没有考虑结构变化。\\n比如：\\n\\\\- 做空止损$33.54，但如果价格回到中枢上沿$32.88附近就该止损了（中枢上沿是关键阻力）\\n\\\\- 做空止盈$30.44是中枢下沿，但如果趋势延续，应该继续持有\\nCaptain，需要调整止损止盈逻辑吗？比如：\\n1. 止损: 用中枢上沿作为止损（不加2%缓冲）\\n2. 止盈: 用中枢下沿作为第一目标，突破后用移动止损跟随\\n3. 结构止损: 30分钟出现反向信号时止损\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e67ca633ca4c27703f654e39cc]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"当前止损止盈逻辑：\n做空（当前信号 SELL @ $32.88）：\n\\- 止损: 中枢上沿 × 1.02 = $32.88 × 1.02 = $33.54\n\\- 止盈: 中枢下沿 = $30.44\n\\- 移动止损: 盈利3%后止损移到入场价\n做多：\n\\- 止损: 中枢下沿 × 0.98\n\\- 止盈: 中枢上沿\n\\- 移动止损: 盈利3%后止损移到入场价\n\n\n---\n\n\n问题：当前逻辑比较简单，止损止盈都是固定百分比，没有考虑结构变化。\n比如：\n\\- 做空止损$33.54，但如果价格回到中枢上沿$32.88附近就该止损了（中枢上沿是关键阻力）\n\\- 做空止盈$30.44是中枢下沿，但如果趋势延续，应该继续持有\nCaptain，需要调整止损止盈逻辑吗？比如：\n1. 止损: 用中枢上沿作为止损（不加2%缓冲）\n2. 止盈: 用中枢下沿作为第一目标，突破后用移动止损跟随\n3. 结构止损: 30分钟出现反向信号时止损\"]\n\n需要调整！止损的核心目的是对入场逻辑的已破坏的止损，止盈是核心是对持仓逻辑的破坏的止损"}],"timestamp":1779775564861}}
{"type":"message","id":"39c1a013","parentId":"990c128e","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:06:30.264Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is giving me a critical insight about stop loss and take profit:\n\n1. **止损的核心目的 = 入场逻辑已破坏的止损** - The stop loss should be where the entry logic is invalidated\n2. **止盈的核心 = 持仓逻辑破坏的止损** - Take profit is actually where the holding logic is invalidated\n\nThis is a fundamental shift from \"fixed percentage\" to \"logic-based\" stops.\n\nFor the current short signal (SELL @ $32.88):\n- **Entry logic**: Daily trend down, shock_sell @ $32.88 (盘整背驰卖点), resonance level 2\n\n\n- **Stop loss**: The entry is invalidated if price breaks back above the shock_sell point at $32.88, since that would mean the divergence signal failed and the downtrend thesis is broken.\n\n- **Take profit**: The downtrend continues as long as price stays below the 30.44 support level, so I'd exit if price reclaims that zone and the bearish structure starts to fail.\n\n- **Trailing stop**: Once price moves in my favor, I can use a small-level bounce as a trailing stop to lock in profits while the trend remains intact.\n\nNow I'm thinking through the core logic: I entered on a daily shock_sell signal with resonance 2 (short position). The entry gets invalidated if price breaks above 32.88 with conviction, since that would invalidate the downtrend thesis. The holding logic breaks down if either price reclaims the previous low at 30.44 (consolidation becomes a reversal) or if a small-level reversal signal appears. So my stop loss sits at 32.88 (the shock_sell entry point), and the take profit targets 30.44 with the option to let profits run if the trend continues.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白了，Captain。这是核心思维转变。\n\n**旧逻辑**：固定百分比止损止盈\n**新逻辑**：入场逻辑破坏 = 止损，持仓逻辑破坏 = 止盈\n\n---\n\n当前做空信号的逻辑重建：\n\n**入场逻辑**：日线 shock_sell @ $32.88（盘整背驰卖点）+ 趋势向下 + 共振2级\n\n**止损 = 入场逻辑破坏**：\n- 价格突破 $32.88（shock_sell 价格）→ 盘整背驰卖点被否定，入场逻辑破坏\n- **止损价：$32.88**（不加缓冲）\n\n**止盈 = 持仓逻辑破坏**：\n- 持仓逻辑：下跌趋势延续，价格应继续创新低\n- 价格回到前低 $30.44 以上 → 下跌趋势可能结束\n- **止盈价：$30.44**（中枢下沿/前低）\n\n**移动止损 = 结构破坏**：\n- 价格跌破 $30.44 后继续下行 → 用小级别反弹作为移动止损\n- 30分钟出现反向信号（买点）→ 结构破坏，平仓\n\n---\n\n更新代码——"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3844ce7872ac4fa5b1f9ea3f","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py","new_string":"        else:\n            # 做空止损 = 入场逻辑破坏：价格突破shock_sell价格\n            plan['stop_loss'] = zs_zg  # 中枢上沿 = 入场逻辑破坏点\n            # 做空止盈 = 持仓逻辑破坏：价格回到前低以上\n            plan['take_profit'] = zs_zd  # 中枢下沿 = 持仓逻辑破坏点\n            plan['trailing_stop'] = 'profit_3pct_move_to_entry'\n            plan['exit_conditions'] = [\n                f\"止损: 价格突破 {plan['stop_loss']:.2f} (入场逻辑破坏: shock_sell被否定)\",\n                f\"止盈: 价格回到 {plan['take_profit']:.2f} (持仓逻辑破坏: 下跌趋势结束)\",\n                \"移动止损: 盈利3%后止损移到入场价\",\n                \"结构止损: 30分钟出现反向买点\"\n            ]","old_string":"        else:\n            # 做空止损：中枢上沿上方2%\n            plan['stop_loss'] = zs_zg * 1.02\n            # 做空止盈：中枢下沿\n            plan['take_profit'] = zs_zd\n            plan['exit_conditions'] = [\n                f\"止损: 突破 {plan['stop_loss']:.2f} (中枢上沿{zs_zg:.2f}×1.02)\",\n                f\"止盈: 到达 {plan['take_profit']:.2f} (中枢下沿)\",\n                \"移动止损: 盈利3%后止损移到入场价\"\n            ]"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":3732,"output":1457,"cacheRead":64384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69573,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779775564863}}
