{"type":"message","id":"a150bfc3","parentId":"a871af1e","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:24:32.113Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is pointing out a critical error! When the short signal was triggered at 13:50, Xiaomi's real-time price was $29.7, but the system used $32.88 (the shock_sell price from the daily analysis).\n\nThe issue is that the signal price should be the current market price, not the historical signal price. The shock_sell @ $32.88 is the price where the daily divergence sell signal occurred (back in May), but when we enter the trade, we should enter at the current market price ($29.7).\n\nLet me check the code to see where this bug is.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain说得对！这是个严重bug。$32.88是5月20日日线shock_sell的历史价格，不是当前市场价。触发信号时应该用**实时价格$29.7**入场。\n\n修复——"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ec5467d4fa304cc2b99cbdd3","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py","limit":30,"offset":590}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1287,"output":379,"cacheRead":90944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":92610,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779776661048}}
