{"type":"message","id":"4f7c4b97","parentId":"52fcd89f","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:29:44.174Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-05-26 14:25:37 GMT+8] Exec failed (warm-orb, signal SIGTERM) :: unknown 2026-05-26 14:20:22,477 [INFO] 💰 持仓中: short @ $32.88 → $32.88 (+0.0%) 2026-05-26 14:25:23,093 [INFO] ⏳ 14:25 价格:$32.88 🔴 日线大趋势: ⬇️下跌趋势 结构:trending 中枢[30.44,32.88] 强度76% …\nSystem: [2026-05-26 14:26:38 GMT+8] Exec failed (amber-gu, signal SIGTERM) :: -05-26 14:26:22,163 [INFO] 数量: 6600 2026-05-26 14:26:22,163 [INFO] 置信度: 60% 2026-05-26 14:26:22,474 [INFO] ⏳ 14:26 价格:$32.88 🔴 日线大趋势: ⬇️下跌趋势 结构:trending 中枢[30.44,32.88] 强度76% 📊 …\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e67928eb49cc23e9289e92fe76\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 14:29 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e67928eb49cc23e9289e92fe76]\nVAN: 怎么触发的空单？！"}],"timestamp":1779776984171}}
{"type":"message","id":"6976b176","parentId":"4f7c4b97","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:30:03.184Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is questioning why the short signal was triggered. Let me think about this...\n\nThe system triggered a SELL short signal based on:\n1. Daily trend is DOWN (trending, 中枢运动 down, 强度76%)\n2. There's a shock_sell @ $32.88 on the daily\n3. 30分钟 also trending\n4. Resonance level 2\n\nBut VAN is questioning this. Let me think about why...\n\nThe issue might be that:\n1. The shock_sell @ $32.88 is a historical signal from May 20th, not a current signal\n2. Price has already dropped from $32.88 to $29.84 - the move has already happened\n\n\n3. I'm trying to enter a short position after the decline has already occurred, which is chasing the move\n\nThe shock_sell signal occurred when price was at $32.88, but now it's at $29.84 - the divergence has already played out. I'm essentially trying to short after the move has already happened, not before it. This is a critical mistake in my signal logic.\n\nI need to clarify whether shock_sell is actually a signal to sell or if it's just a historical reference point, and whether the system should be entering trades on old signals or only on fresh ones.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain说得对，我犯了个严重错误。\n\n**shock_sell @ $32.88 是5月20日的历史信号**，当时价格在$32.88。现在价格已经跌到$29.84了——**行情已经走完了**。\n\n我在用一个已经过期的历史信号触发入场，这是**追跌**，不是顺势。\n\n**正确的逻辑应该是：**\n- shock_sell @ $32.88 是**参考**，说明下跌趋势中有一个背驰卖点\n- 但现在价格已经跌了10%，这个信号**已经失效**\n- 应该等**新的信号**出现才能入场\n\n修复信号逻辑——"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0b976ecd66a149eabb0519a4","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py","new_string":"        # ---- 下跌趋势：找卖点做空 ----\n        if direction == 'short' and strategy == 'trend_follow_short':\n            # 先找30分钟卖点（实时信号）\n            sell_points_30 = [b for b in min30_bsp if 'sell' in b.get('type', '')]\n            if sell_points_30:\n                best_point = max(sell_points_30, key=lambda x: x.get('confidence', 0))\n                source = '30min'\n\n            # 日线卖点只作为参考，不直接触发入场\n            # 历史信号已经走完的不能用\n\n            action = 'SELL'  # 做空 = SELL","old_string":"        # ---- 下跌趋势：找卖点做空 ----\n        if direction == 'short' and strategy == 'trend_follow_short':\n            # 先找30分钟卖点\n            sell_points_30 = [b for b in min30_bsp if 'sell' in b.get('type', '')]\n            if sell_points_30:\n                best_point = max(sell_points_30, key=lambda x: x.get('confidence', 0))\n                source = '30min'\n\n            # 再找日线卖点（顺势卖点）\n            if not best_point:\n                sell_points_d = [b for b in daily_bsp if 'sell' in b.get('type', '')]\n                if sell_points_d:\n                    best_point = max(sell_points_d, key=lambda x: x.get('confidence', 0))\n                    source = 'daily'\n\n            action = 'SELL'  # 做空 = SELL"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":778,"output":1131,"cacheRead":101440,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103349,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779776984173}}
