{"type":"message","id":"552f63a0","parentId":"3b0ae2e1","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:31:28.192Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The system is now correctly showing no trading signal because there's no 30min sell point. The monitor is running and showing the current price at $29.80.\n\nLet me give VAN a summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"监控已重启，当前状态：\n\n```\n⏳ 14:31 价格:$29.80\n📊 日线大趋势: ⬇️下跌趋势  强度76%\n🎯 策略: trend_follow_short  共振:2级\n⏳ 无交易信号\n```\n\n**正确行为**：日线趋势向下，但30分钟没有卖点 → 不入场。等30分钟出现卖点再做空。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_877bbb0ea8444e069ce9d69b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> /workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-26.md << 'EOF'\n\n### 🐛 历史信号入场bug修复 (14:30)\n\n**问题**: 用5月20日的历史shock_sell @ $32.88触发入场，但价格已跌到$29.84，行情已走完\n**本质**: 追跌，不是顺势\n**修复**: 日线买卖点只作为参考，不直接触发入场。只有30分钟实时信号才触发入场\n**结果**: 当前30分钟无卖点 → 不入场，等待新信号\n\n**教训**: 历史信号≠实时信号。信号触发必须基于实时数据，不能用已过期的历史信号\nEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":409,"output":377,"cacheRead":104512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105298,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779777078329}}
