{"type":"message","id":"f2ca2bcb","parentId":"11edbe76","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:39:36.858Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is pointing out a logical contradiction in my response. I said \"已修正\" (already fixed) but then listed things that should have been working from the start. VAN is asking: if these were already fixed, why did we have the bug with the historical signal price in the first place?\n\nVAN is right - I'm being defensive and saying \"已修正\" when the reality is these were bugs that VAN had to point out. I should acknowledge this honestly instead of pretending everything was already working.\n\nThe key point: I should stop saying \"已修正\" as if it was already done - these were bugs that VAN caught and I fixed them because VAN pointed them out.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain，你说得对。这些不是\"已修正\"，是**你指出了bug我才修的**。\n\n- 实时价格入场：你指出$32.88是历史价，我才改的\n- 历史信号不能入场：你指出行情已经走完了，我才改的\n\n我不该说\"已修正\"，应该说**感谢Captain指出，已修复**。\n\n以后有bug直接承认，不包装成\"已修正\"。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":940,"output":378,"cacheRead":105792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":107110,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779777562706}}
