{"type":"message","id":"a129f371","parentId":"4a0d4e1c","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:51:36.283Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is pointing out a contradiction in my behavior. Let me understand:\n\n1. I said I fixed the system to use real-time prices\n2. I said the historical signal has already played out (10% drop from $32.88 to $29.84)\n3. I said there's no 30min sell signal\n4. But then I still triggered a SELL signal at $29.84!\n\nVAN is right - if:\n- The historical shock_sell @ $32.88 has already played out (price dropped 10%)\n- There's no 30min sell signal\n- Then WHY did I still trigger a SELL signal?\n\n\nThe real problem is that my logic is checking for 30min sell signals, but when it doesn't find one, it's falling back to the daily shock_sell signal anyway - which completely contradicts what I told VAN about waiting for a real-time signal. I need to verify whether my latest fix actually prevents this fallback behavior or if there's still a code path allowing the old signal to trigger. I need to be direct with VAN - I claimed to have fixed the issue, but I clearly didn't implement it properly since the system still triggered that sell signal at $29.84.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain，你说得对。我犯了两个矛盾：\n\n1. 我说\"行情已走完，信号已失效\"——但还是用它触发了SELL @ $29.84\n2. 我说\"等30分钟实时信号\"——但30分钟没有卖点，我还是入场了\n\n**根本问题**：我没有彻底修复。代码里还有逻辑漏洞——当30分钟没有卖点时，系统仍然找到了某个点入场。\n\n让我彻底检查信号生成逻辑——"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_75f276058c6f4f00be901cb9","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py","limit":50,"offset":730}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1241,"output":704,"cacheRead":107200,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":109145,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779778266797}}
{"type":"message","id":"52e27a5f","parentId":"a129f371","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:51:36.290Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_75f276058c6f4f00be901cb9","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"            return None\n\n        # 盘整不交易\n        if analysis.strategy == 'range_wait':\n            return None\n\n        direction = analysis.direction  # 'long' or 'short'\n        strategy = analysis.strategy\n\n        daily_bsp = analysis.daily.get('buy_sell_points', [])\n        min30_bsp = analysis.min30.get('buy_sell_points', []) if analysis.min30 else []\n\n        best_point = None\n        source = ''\n        action = ''\n\n        # ---- 下跌趋势：找卖点做空 ----\n        if direction == 'short' and strategy == 'trend_follow_short':\n            # 先找30分钟卖点（实时信号）\n            sell_points_30 = [b for b in min30_bsp if 'sell' in b.get('type', '')]\n            if sell_points_30:\n                best_point = max(sell_points_30, key=lambda x: x.get('confidence', 0))\n                source = '30min'\n\n            # 日线卖点只作为参考，不直接触发入场\n            # 历史信号已经走完的不能用\n\n            action = 'SELL'  # 做空 = SELL\n\n        # ---- 上升趋势：找买点做多 ----\n        elif direction == 'long' and strategy == 'trend_follow_long':\n            # 先找30分钟买点（实时信号）\n            buy_points_30 = [b for b in min30_bsp if 'buy' in b.get('type', '')]\n            if buy_points_30:\n                best_point = max(buy_points_30, key=lambda x: x.get('confidence', 0))\n                source = '30min'\n\n            # 日线买点只作为参考，不直接触发入场\n\n            action = 'BUY'\n\n        if not best_point:\n            return None\n\n        # 仓位计算 — 使用实时价格，不是历史信号价格\n        account_value = self.get_account_value()\n        entry_pct = analysis.entry_plan.get('position_pct', 0.2)\n        # 获取实时价格\n        current_price = self._get_realtime_price()\n        if not current_price:\n\n[315 more lines in file. Use offset=780 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779778296288}}
{"type":"message","id":"6e2c0da8","parentId":"52e27a5f","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:51:50.350Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The code looks correct now. The issue is that when I ran the test, the system still triggered a signal. Let me check if there was a cached version of the code running.\n\nActually, looking at the code, the fix is there:\n1. Only looks for 30min sell points\n2. If no 30min sell point → best_point is None → returns None\n\nBut the monitor output showed:\n```\n🎯 发现交易信号! daily shock_sell | 共振2级 | trend_follow_short | short\n```\n\nThis means the signal was triggered from a `daily shock_sell`, not from 30min. But the code says \"日线卖点只作为参考，不直接触发入场\". So how did the daily shock_sell trigger?\n \nI'm realizing the monitor might have been running an older cached version of the code before I applied the fix, since the process was started before the latest changes. But I killed and restarted it afterward, so it should have picked up the new code. Let me verify whether the monitor is actually using the updated logic or if there's still a cached version running.\n\nLooking at the signal generation code, when direction is 'short' and strategy is 'trend_follow_short', it sets action to 'SELL' regardless of whether a best_point is found. Then it checks `if not best_point: return None`, so if there's no 30min sell signal, it should return None and not trigger anything. But the monitor output showed a signal with the daily shock_sell, which suggests either the monitor was running old code or there's something else triggering the signal that I'm missing.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d5eb97f2c17e4f229296d38c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading && python3 -c \"\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nsys.path.insert(0, '..')\nfrom xiaomi_paper_trader import XiaomiPaperTrader\nt = XiaomiPaperTrader()\nanalysis = t.multi_