{"type":"compaction","id":"bab343e6","parentId":"a24aac05","timestamp":"2026-05-26T06:53:30.718Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. Prepare for and monitor Hong Kong stock market (HK) Asian trading session, specifically Xiaomi 01810\n2. **Rewrite core trading analysis logic** to align with correct 缠论 (Chanlun) cognitive framework: **大级别定方向，小级别找机会** (macro level determines direction, micro level finds opportunities)\n3. Upgrade `xiaomi_paper_trader.py` to integrate intelligent level v2.0 with correct trend-first analysis\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Max single trade loss: 2% (default) / 3% (current code uses 3%)\n- VAN's core principle: \"凡强趋必然浅回调，不论多空\" (strong trends always have shallow pullbacks)\n- Smooth fluent trends = small timeframe level = main target\n- System must use StructureState-driven level selection\n- Trading assistant persona: 🦞 Trading Assistant\n- **VAN要求**: 每次汇报必须带具体参数（价格/中枢/笔/背驰/流畅度），不要模板式报告\n- **核心认知原则**: 先判趋势再找机会，顺势而为。下跌趋势中做空才是顺势，做多是逆势\n- **止损止盈核心原则**: 止损 = 入场逻辑已破坏的止损；止盈 = 持仓逻辑破坏的止损。不是固定百分比，而是逻辑驱动\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Session startup, memory restore from 2026-05-25 and 2026-05-26\n- [x] Pre-market analysis of Xiaomi 01810: daily=turning (shock_exhaustion divergence 60%), ZS [31.20,32.94], price 30.00 below ZS\n- [x] 30-min analysis: unknown state, ZS [30.14,30.60], no divergence\n- [x] Launched `xiaomi_paper_trader.py --monitor` (background process, running since 09:01)\n- [x] Monitored Xiaomi through morning session: $30.02→$29.72→$30.36 (oscillating, no signals)\n- [x] Multiple auto-memory updates (08:00, 09:00, 10:00, 11:00, 12:00, 13:00, 14:00)\n- [x] Multiple session archives (07to08, 07to10, 10to12, current)\n- [x] Backup sync to ai-trading-sync (commit c14f881)\n- [x] Backed up original: `xiaomi_paper_trader.py.bak_v1`\n- [x] Read full `czsc_extension.py` (v2.0 API with StructureState, get_structure_state(), etc.)\n- [x] **Fixed Direction enum bug** in `czsc_extension.py`: 17 places replaced `direction == 'up'` → `direction == Direction.Up/Direction.Down` — buy/sell detection was completely broken before\n- [x] Post-fix verification: detected `shock_sell @ $32.88`, full analysis: one_buy $28.80 (04-30), one_sell $32.88 (05-44), current $30.016\n- [x] **VAN sent Captain's 缠论级别分析梳理** — correct analysis showing daily trend is DOWN from 61.45, 04-30 buy was just consolidation divergence bounce, real opportunity is SHORTING\n- [x] **Cognitive alignment achieved**: AI acknowledged fundamental error of \"在下跌趋势里找做多机会=逆势思维\"\n- [x] Recorded cognitive alignment to `memory/2026-05-26.md` and `MEMORY.md`\n- [x] **v2.1 顺势改造完成**: Rewrote `_determine_strategy()`, `_build_entry_plan()`, `_generate_signal()` for trend-following logic\n- [x] **止损止盈逻辑重构 (14:06)**: Changed from fixed percentage (中枢上沿×1.02) to logic-driven (中枢上沿 = entry invalidation point)\n  - Stop loss: $32.88 (was $33.54) — entry logic invalidation: shock_sell被否定\n  - Take profit: $30.44 — holding logic invalidation: 下跌趋势结束\n  - Structural stop: 30分钟出现反向买点\n  - Same logic applied to long side: stop = 中枢下沿 (buy point invalidation), profit = 中枢上沿 (trend end)\n- [x] Restarted monitor with updated stop loss logic (new PID 233261, session vivid-nexus)\n- [x] Session archive: `memory/sessions/2026-05-26-feishu-current.md` created with full summary\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] Monitor running with v2.1 logic + updated stop/profit (PID 233261, session vivid-nexus) — observing signal execution\n- [ ] Add daily trend reversal buy point detection\n- [ ] Add structural stop (30min反向信号) implementation in code\n\n### Blocked\n- (none currently)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Upgrade xiaomi_paper_trader.py**: VAN confirmed \"马上\" to upgrade; old code uses `ext.bi_list`, `ext.calc_zs_list()`, `ext.detect_divergence()` — needs to use `ext.get_structure_state()` returning StructureState\n- **Direction bug fix**: `czsc_extension.py` had `direction == 'up'` but czsc returns `Direction.Up` enum — 17 replacements, buy/sell detection was completely broken\n- **Cognitive framework correction (CRITICAL)**: Analysis must follow: ①日线大趋势→②有没有反转→③买卖点性质→④当下该做什么. Old logic \"找背驰→发现买点→做多\" is WRONG. New logic \"定趋势→判断反转→顺势找机会\" is correct\n- **盘整背驰买点 = 短期回抽，不等于反转信号**: The 04-30 buy at $28.80 was a consolidation divergence bounce within a downtrend, NOT a reversal signal\n- **Xiaomi current correct assessment**: Daily trend DOWN (中枢下移-11.8%), trend NOT ended, real opportunity is SHORTING or waiting for daily trend reversal buy point\n- **VAN delegated full project ownership**: \"整个项目由你负责\" — AI must make autonomous decisions on system architecture\n- **Not entering Xiaomi now**: Price ~$30.16-30.36, daily trend down, wait for either short entry on bounce or daily reversal confirmation\n- **Archive automation**: 3 cron jobs running (hourly memory, 2hr session archive, daily memory archive)\n- **止损止盈逻辑 = 逻辑驱动，非固定百分比**: VAN's critical teaching: \"止损的核心目的是对入场逻辑的已破坏的止损，止盈是核心是对持仓逻辑的破坏的止损\". Stop = entry logic invalidation; Take profit = holding logic invalidation\n- **v2.1 顺势策略**: 下跌趋势找卖点做空(shock_sell)，上升趋势找买点做多(shock_buy). 数据范围日线90天→180天（足够笔和中枢判断趋势）\n- **position_pct不能为0**: 30分钟无卖点时默认0.2仓位，否则信号被跳过\n\n## Next Steps\n1. **Monitor current short signal** (SELL @ $32.88, SL $32.88, TP $30.44) — observe execution and outcome\n2. **Implement structural stop in code**: 30分钟出现反向信号时自动平仓（currently only in exit_conditions text, not auto-executed）\n3. **Add daily trend reversal buy point detection**: When daily trend reversal confirmed, switch to long mode\n4. **Further optimize stop/profit logic**: VAN may request additional refinements after observing current logic performance\n5. **Add dynamic trailing stop**: Once price moves past TP ($30.44), use small-level bounces as trailing stop to let profits run with trend\n\n## Critical Context\n- **Files**:\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py` — main file, v2.1 with logic-driven stops\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py.bak_v1` — backup of v1\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py` — v2.0 API (StructureState, CzscExtension) — Direction bug fixed\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/hk_a_plan.md` — HK trading plan with rules\n- **v2.0 API key patterns**:\n  - `ext = CzscExtension(czsc_obj, symbol='01810', timeframe='daily')`\n  - `state = ext.get_structure_state()` (takes NO args, only self)\n  - `state.state` → 'trending'/'ranging'/'turning'/'unknown'\n  - `state.should_follow_trend()` / `state.should_wait_breakout()` / `state.should_catch_reversal()`\n  - BI attributes: `bi.fx_a.fx`, `bi.fx_b.fx`, `bi.high`, `bi.low`, `bi.power`, `bi.direction.value` ('up'/'down')\n  - CZSC init: `CZSC(formatted_bars)` (no freq kwarg); use `format_standard_kline(df, freq=Freq.D)`\n  - Freq enum: `Freq.D`, `Freq.F30`, `Freq.F5` (NOT `Freq.M30`)\n- **Tiger SDK**: `get_briefs(['01810'])` returns list of QuoteBrief objects (not iterable single); use `quote_client.get_bars()` for historical data\n- **Monitor log**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_trader.log`\n- **Memory files**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-26.md`, `/workspace/projects/workspace/MEMORY.md`\n- **Current Xiaomi price**: ~$30.016-30.36, daily ZS [31.20, 32.94] → [30.44, 32.88] (second ZS), 30min ZS [30.14, 30.60]\n- **Current short position**: SELL short @ $32.88, SL $32.88, TP $30.44, qty 6000, 共振2级, strategy trend_follow_short\n- **Monitor process**: PID 233261, session vivid-nexus (restarted 14:07 with updated stop logic)\n- **Correct Xiaomi 缠论 analysis (from Captain's document)**:\n  - Daily downtrend from 61.45, second daily ZS forming, breaking below it\n  - 04-30 buy ($28.80) = consolidation divergence bounce, NOT reversal\n  - Trend divergence confirmed, possible final sharp decline ahead\n  - Real opportunity: SHORTING or wait for daily trend reversal buy point\n  - Small-level buy2 (not breaking $28.80) = 30min/5min level only, must exit at small-level sell\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\n\nVAN instructed the assistant to autonomously optimize and adjust the paper trading system's stop loss / take profit logic based on the principle: 止损 = 入场逻辑破坏 (stop loss = entry logic invalidation), 止盈 = 持仓逻辑破坏 (take profit = holding logic invalidation). A system log showed a `shock_sell` signal at $32.88 with a stop at $33.54 for 6000 quantity.\n\n## Early Progress\n\nThe assistant began reviewing the current code in `xiaomi_paper_trader.py` (the Xiaomi paper trading system, v2.1). Key findings and plans:\n\n1. **Current `_build_exit_plan` method**: Uses a single daily zhongshu (中枢) level for stop/take profit, with zg (中枢上沿) and zd (中枢下沿). It has basic trailing stop logic (move to entry after 3% profit).\n\n2. **Design for multi-level exit plan**: The assistant planned to redesign exits with:\n   - **Signal-level stop**: Invalidates the specific signal entry\n   - **Structure-level stop**: Invalidates the current structure\n   - **Trend-level stop**: Invalidates the trend\n   - **Dynamic trailing stops**: Break-even after 2% profit, structural stop on 30min reverse signal\n   - Multiple take profit targets (previous low/high, next support/resistance, trend continuation)\n\n3. **Identified gap**: `execute_trade` doesn't actually monitor for exit conditions during the trade lifecycle. The `run_monitor` loop calls `_generate_signal` but lacks real-time position exit monitoring (stop loss, take profit, structural exit triggers).\n\n4. **New exit plan structure** designed with separate `stop_loss`, `take_profit`, `trailing_stops`, and `exit_conditions` fields, each with price, type, and reason.\n\n## Context for Suffix\n\nThe assistant was mid-way through reading the `run_monitor` loop (offset 700+) to understand the full monitoring flow before implementing the optimized exit logic. The suffix will contain the continuation of reading the monitor loop and the actual code modifications to implement the multi-level stop/take profit system. Key files: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py`.","firstKeptEntryId":"2b08d130","tokensBefore":111624,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":false}
