{"type":"message","id":"50dfa365","parentId":"c7242cbd","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:25:59.779Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The CRCL monitor is now working with Finnhub real-time data:\n- Price: $108.37\n- Change: -4.1991%\n- Daily trend: DOWN\n- 5min trend: DOWN\n- No signal (HOLD)\n\nThe monitor is running and showing real-time data. Let me give VAN a summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ **美股监控已启动，Finnhub实时数据正常。**\n\n```\n📊 CRCL 缠论实时监控\n⏰ 2026-05-26 22:25:19\n\n💰 行情:\n  价格: $108.37\n  涨跌: -4.1991%\n\n📈 日线结构:\n  趋势: down\n  笔: 19 | 中枢: 6\n  中枢区间: [89.90, 111.20]\n  背驰: 否\n\n📉 5分钟结构:\n  趋势: down\n  笔: 10 | 中枢: 3\n\n📡 信号:\n  ⚪ [HOLD] 无明确信号，继续观察\n```\n\n港股小米监控 + 美股CRCL监控 都在运行。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1008,"output":354,"cacheRead":100608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101970,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779805551338}}
{"type":"message","id":"1404307b","parentId":"50dfa365","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:31:36.525Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-05-26 22:20:23 GMT+8] Exec completed (fresh-su, code 0) :: 📈 日线结构: 趋势: down 笔: 19 | 中枢: 6 中枢区间: [89.90, 111.20] 最后一笔: 向下 背驰: 否 📉 5分钟结构: 趋势: down 笔: 10 | 中枢: 3 📡 信号: ⚪ [HOLD] 无明确信号，继续观察 💼 持仓: 空仓 💰 账户: 权益: $10000.00 可用: $10000.00 已实现盈亏…\nSystem: [2026-05-26 22:24:13 GMT+8] Exec failed (gentle-b, signal SIGTERM) :: ===================================== 📊 CRCL 缠论实时监控 ⏰ 2026-05-26 22:20:51 ============================================================ 💰 行情: 价格: $0.0 涨跌: 0.0% 📈 日线结构: 趋势: down …\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e6ea2bae4a4c25c5ad4cdcfd00\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-05-26 22:31 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e6ea2bae4a4c25c5ad4cdcfd00]\nVAN: 你现在怎么么一个标的写个系统，不应该是一套系统，随时切换增加标的吗"}],"timestamp":1779805896520}}
{"type":"message","id":"2b0e36ae","parentId":"1404307b","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:31:45.977Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is making an excellent point. Currently I have separate monitoring scripts for each stock (xiaomi_paper_trader.py for Xiaomi, crcl_monitor.py for CRCL). This is not scalable. \n\nVAN is right - there should be ONE trading system that can monitor multiple stocks, and you just add/remove symbols as needed. This is a fundamental architecture issue.\n\nI need to acknowledge this and commit to refactoring into a unified system.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain说得对。现在是每个标的一个脚本，这是错的。\n\n**应该是一套统一系统**：\n- 一个 `trader.py` 核心引擎\n- 配置文件决定监控哪些标的\n- 随时添加/移除标的，不改代码\n- 共享分析引擎、风控、下单逻辑\n\n现在的架构：\n```\nxiaomi_paper_trader.py  → 小米专用\ncrcl_monitor.py         → CRCL专用\n```\n\n正确的架构：\n```\ntrader.py               → 通用引擎\nportfolio.json          → 标的列表 + 持仓\nconfig.json             → 策略参数\n```\n\n明天开盘前我会重构为统一系统。这是基本架构问题，一开始就该这样做。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":908,"output":343,"cacheRead":101568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102819,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779805896524}}
