{"type":"message","id":"94a4464a","parentId":"92514771","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:33:08.291Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is right to question this. Why am I waiting until tomorrow? The market is closed now (Hong Kong market closed at 16:00, US market is still open but CRCL has no signal). I should start the refactoring now, not delay it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain说得对，现在就开始。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2445108b284b4b2c8dc5053b","name":"exec","arguments":{"background":true,"command":"mkdir -p /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified && cat > /workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified/README.md << 'EOF'\n# 统一交易系统\n\n## 架构\n- `engine.py` — 核心引擎（缠论分析+信号生成+风控+下单）\n- `portfolio.json` — 标的列表+持仓\n- `config.json` — 策略参数\n- `monitor.py` — 监控入口\n\n## 设计原则\n- 一套系统，多标的\n- 配置驱动，不改代码\n- 共享引擎、风控、下单逻辑\nEOF","yieldMs":5000}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":538,"output":313,"cacheRead":102464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103315,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779805978727}}
