{"type":"compaction","id":"5bac33d2","parentId":"4192d1c6","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:38:00.131Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. Prepare for and monitor Hong Kong stock market (HK) Asian trading session, specifically Xiaomi 01810\n2. **Rewrite core trading analysis logic** to align with correct 缠论 (Chanlun) cognitive framework: **大级别定方向，小级别找机会** (macro level determines direction, micro level finds opportunities)\n3. Upgrade `xiaomi_paper_trader.py` to integrate intelligent level v2.0 with correct trend-first analysis\n4. **Ensure all trading infrastructure is production-ready before market open** — Tiger order execution, stop/take-profit logic, real-time data source\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Max single trade loss: 2% (default) / 3% (current code uses 3%)\n- VAN's core principle: \"凡强趋必然浅回调，不论多空\" (strong trends always have shallow pullbacks)\n- Smooth fluent trends = small timeframe level = main target\n- System must use StructureState-driven level selection\n- Trading assistant persona: 🦞 Trading Assistant\n- **VAN要求**: 每次汇报必须带具体参数（价格/中枢/笔/背驰/流畅度），不要模板式报告\n- **核心认知原则**: 先判趋势再找机会，顺势而为。下跌趋势中做空才是顺势，做多是逆势\n- **止损止盈核心原则**: 止损 = 入场逻辑已破坏的止损；止盈 = 持仓逻辑破坏的止损。不是固定百分比，而是逻辑驱动\n- **VAN's frustration**: AI must proactively ensure infrastructure readiness — not wait for Captain to point out missing integrations. Tiger order execution should have been verified before market open. VAN: \"该做好什么应该你来主导，而不是我每次提醒你\"\n- **Bug honesty principle**: When VAN points out a bug, admit it directly (\"Captain指出，已修复\") — don't repackage as \"已修正\"\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Session startup, memory restore from 2026-05-25 and 2026-05-26\n- [x] Pre-market analysis of Xiaomi 01810: daily=turning (shock_exhaustion divergence 60%), ZS [31.20,32.94], price 30.00 below ZS\n- [x] 30-min analysis: unknown state, ZS [30.14,30.60], no divergence\n- [x] Launched `xiaomi_paper_trader.py --monitor` (background process, running since 09:01)\n- [x] Monitored Xiaomi through morning session: $30.02→$29.72→$30.36 (oscillating, no signals)\n- [x] Multiple auto-memory updates (08:00, 09:00, 10:00, 11:00, 12:00, 13:00, 14:00, 15:00)\n- [x] Multiple session archives (07to08, 07to10, 10to12, current)\n- [x] Backup sync to ai-trading-sync (commit c14f881)\n- [x] Backed up original: `xiaomi_paper_trader.py.bak_v1`\n- [x] Read full `czsc_extension.py` (v2.0 API with StructureState, get_structure_state(), etc.)\n- [x] **Fixed Direction enum bug** in `czsc_extension.py`: 17 places replaced `direction == 'up'` → `direction == Direction.Up/Direction.Down`\n- [x] Post-fix verification: detected `shock_sell @ $32.88`, full analysis\n- [x] **Cognitive alignment achieved**: AI acknowledged fundamental error of \"在下跌趋势里找做多机会=逆势思维\"\n- [x] Recorded cognitive alignment to `memory/2026-05-26.md` and `MEMORY.md`\n- [x] **v2.1 顺势改造完成**: Rewrote `_determine_strategy()`, `_build_entry_plan()`, `_generate_signal()` for trend-following logic\n- [x] **止损止盈逻辑重构 (14:06)**: Changed from fixed percentage to logic-driven (中枢上沿 = entry invalidation point)\n- [x] **三层止损体系上线 (14:06-14:10)**: 入场止损(逻辑位+0.5%缓冲), 结构止损(30min反向信号), 移动止损(盈利2%→入场价)\n- [x] **实时价格修复 (14:22-14:26)**: 新增 `_get_realtime_price()`, 入场价改为实时价格\n- [x] **历史信号入场bug修复 (14:29-14:30)**: shock_sell @ $32.88是5月20日信号，行情已走完。修复: 日线买卖点只作参考，30分钟实时信号才触发入场\n- [x] **VAN诚实教导 (14:39-14:43)**: 有bug直接承认，不包装\n- [x] Session archive `memory/sessions/2026-05-26-feishu-current.md` created\n- [x] Memory flush at 14:59 — appended session summary, core lessons, code changes to `memory/2026-05-26.md` and `MEMORY.md`\n- [x] Git push to origin (commits 0e35f30d→b14f4cb3→71f6beb8)\n- [x] **Tiger模拟盘下单对接 (15:12-15:16)**: VAN pointed out `execute_trade` was only writing local JSON, not placing actual orders on Tiger. Fixed:\n  - Added import: `from tiger_client import place_order_limit, place_order_market` with correct path `_tiger_path = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent.parent / 'skills' / 'tiger-broker'`\n  - Rewrote `execute_trade()`: now calls `place_order_limit()` to actually place orders on Tiger simulated account\n  - Rewrote `execute_exit()`: now calls `place_order_limit()` for closing positions on Tiger simulated account\n  - Both functions now log `tiger_result` in trade records\n- [x] Restarted monitor with Tiger order execution (PID 239561, session nimble-kelp)\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] Monitor running with v2.1 logic + Tiger order execution (PID 239561, session nimble-kelp) — observing signal execution\n- [ ] Add daily trend reversal buy point detection\n- [ ] Implement structural stop auto-execution (30min反向信号)\n\n### Blocked\n- (none currently)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Upgrade xiaomi_paper_trader.py**: VAN confirmed \"马上\" to upgrade; old code uses `ext.bi_list`, `ext.calc_zs_list()`, `ext.detect_divergence()` — needs to use `ext.get_structure_state()` returning StructureState\n- **Direction bug fix**: `czsc_extension.py` had `direction == 'up'` but czsc returns `Direction.Up` enum — 17 replacements\n- **Cognitive framework correction (CRITICAL)**: Analysis: ①日线大趋势→②有没有反转→③买卖点性质→④当下该做什么\n- **盘整背驰买点 = 短期回抽，不等于反转信号**: The 04-30 buy at $28.80 was a consolidation divergence bounce within a downtrend\n- **Xiaomi current correct assessment**: Daily trend DOWN (中枢下移-11.8%), trend NOT ended, real opportunity is SHORTING or waiting for daily trend reversal buy point\n- **VAN delegated full project ownership**: \"整个项目由你负责\" — AI must make autonomous decisions\n- **止损止盈逻辑 = 逻辑驱动，非固定百分比**: VAN's critical teaching\n- **v2.1 顺势策略**: 下跌趋势找卖点做空(shock_sell)，上升趋势找买点做多(shock_buy)\n- **position_pct不能为0**: 30分钟无卖点时默认0.2仓位\n- **历史信号≠实时信号**: 日线买卖点只作为参考，只有30分钟实时信号才触发入场\n- **Tiger order execution is MANDATORY**: `execute_trade` and `execute_exit` must call `place_order_limit()` — not local JSON. VAN's expectation: this should have been done before market open, never ask permission for basic infrastructure\n- **Proactive system readiness**: AI must do full pre-market system checks (Tiger order channel, stop/profit logic, real-time data source) before each trading day without waiting for VAN to remind\n\n## Next Steps\n1. **Verify Tiger order execution works end-to-end** when next signal triggers (currently no position, waiting for 30min sell signal)\n2. **Implement structural stop auto-execution**: 30分钟出现反向信号时自动平仓\n3. **Add daily trend reversal buy point detection**: When daily trend reversal confirmed, switch to long mode\n4. **Pre-market checklist automation**: Build a pre-market system check that verifies Tiger order channel, data sources, stop/profit logic before each trading day\n5. **Add dynamic trailing stop**: Once price moves past TP, use small-level bounces as trailing stop\n6. **Commit and push Tiger integration changes**\n\n## Critical Context\n- **Files**:\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py` — main file, v2.1 with Tiger order execution + logic-driven stops\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py.bak_v1` — backup of v1\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py` — v2.0 API (StructureState, CzscExtension) — Direction bug fixed\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/hk_a_plan.md` — HK trading plan with rules\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/tiger-broker/tiger_client.py` — Tiger order functions (`place_order_limit`, `place_order_market`)\n- **v2.0 API key patterns**:\n  - `ext = CzscExtension(czsc_obj, symbol='01810', timeframe='daily')`\n  - `state = ext.get_structure_state()` (takes NO args, only self)\n  - `state.state` → 'trending'/'ranging'/'turning'/'unknown'\n  - `state.should_follow_trend()` / `state.should_wait_breakout()` / `state.should_catch_reversal()`\n  - BI attributes: `bi.fx_a.fx`, `bi.fx_b.fx`, `bi.high`, `bi.low`, `bi.power`, `bi.direction.value` ('up'/'down')\n  - CZSC init: `CZSC(formatted_bars)` (no freq kwarg); use `format_standard_kline(df, freq=Freq.D)`\n  - Freq enum: `Freq.D`, `Freq.F30`, `Freq.F5` (NOT `Freq.M30`)\n- **Tiger SDK**: `get_briefs(['01810'])` returns list of QuoteBrief objects; use `quote_client.get_bars()` for historical data; `trade_client.place_order(order)` for execution\n- **Monitor log**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_trader.log`\n- **Memory files**: `/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-26.md`, `/workspace/projects/workspace/MEMORY.md`\n- **Current Xiaomi price**: ~$29.82-29.88, daily ZS [30.44, 32.88], 30min ZS [30.14, 30.60]\n- **Current position**: NO POSITION (30min无卖点, 不入场)\n- **Monitor process**: PID 239561, session nimble-kelp (restarted 15:16 with Tiger order execution)\n- **Correct Xiaomi 缠论 analysis**:\n  - Daily downtrend from 61.45, second daily ZS forming, breaking below it\n  - 04-30 buy ($28.80) = consolidation divergence bounce, NOT reversal\n  - Real opportunity: SHORTING or wait for daily trend reversal buy point\n- **Tiger order execution path fix**: `Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent.parent / 'skills' / 'tiger-broker'` (3 levels up from paper-trading to workspace, then into skills/tiger-broker)\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nA scheduled reminder was triggered to execute an automatic memory update: run `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/auto-memory.sh`, check today's conversations for important information, and supplement it to `memory/今天.md` if needed.\n\n## Early Progress\n- This is a system-triggered scheduled task (not a direct user request)\n- The task involves running a memory management script and reviewing the day's conversations for important notes\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- The assistant needs to execute a bash script at `/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/auto-memory.sh`\n- After running the script, it should check if today's conversations contain important information worth saving to `memory/今天.md`\n- Current time context: Tuesday, May 26th, 2026, 4:00 PM Asia/Shanghai","firstKeptEntryId":"cb5c3e70","tokensBefore":112084,"d