{"type":"message","id":"1a4e2f3f","parentId":"8eb698e9","timestamp":"2026-05-26T14:57:59.397Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is saying \"没有\" (no/missing something). He's likely pointing out that I didn't test something, or that the test was incomplete. Let me think about what might be missing.\n\nLooking at my test, I tested:\n1. Place order - ✅\n2. Query open orders - ✅\n3. Cancel order - ✅\n\nBut I didn't test:\n- Sell order\n- Market order\n- Order execution (fill)\n- Position query after fill\n\nVAN might be pointing out that I only tested BUY, not SELL. Or that I didn't test the full cycle including execution. Let me ask what's missing.\n\nActually, VAN might be saying that the test wasn't complete or that I missed something important. Let me ask him to clarify what's missing.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain，我漏了什么？请指出，我来补。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":515,"output":345,"cacheRead":77696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78556,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779807473452}}
