{"type":"compaction","id":"24f497c2","parentId":"915720e2","timestamp":"2026-05-26T15:31:06.481Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. Prepare for and monitor Hong Kong stock market (HK) Asian trading session, specifically Xiaomi 01810\n2. **Rewrite core trading analysis logic** to align with correct 缠论 (Chanlun) cognitive framework: **大级别定方向，小级别找机会** (macro level determines direction, micro level finds opportunities)\n3. Upgrade `xiaomi_paper_trader.py` to integrate intelligent level v2.0 with correct trend-first analysis\n4. **Ensure all trading infrastructure is production-ready before market open** — Tiger order execution, stop/take-profit logic, real-time data source\n5. **Build unified trading system** — one engine, configurable symbols, not one script per symbol\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Max single trade loss: 2% (default) / 3% (current code uses 3%)\n- VAN's core principle: \"凡强趋必然浅回调，不论多空\" (strong trends always have shallow pullbacks)\n- Smooth fluent trends = small timeframe level = main target\n- System must use StructureState-driven level selection\n- Trading assistant persona: 🦞 Trading Assistant\n- **VAN要求**: 每次汇报必须带具体参数（价格/中枢/笔/背驰/流畅度），不要模板式报告\n- **核心认知原则**: 先判趋势再找机会，顺势而为。下跌趋势中做空才是顺势，做多是逆势\n- **止损止盈核心原则**: 止损 = 入场逻辑已破坏的止损；止盈 = 持仓逻辑破坏的止损。不是固定百分比，而是逻辑驱动\n- **VAN's frustration**: AI must proactively ensure infrastructure readiness — not wait for Captain to point out missing integrations\n- **Bug honesty principle**: When VAN points out a bug, admit it directly (\"Captain指出，已修复\") — don't repackage as \"已修正\"\n- **Architecture principle (22:52)**: \"系统始终是统一的在不断迭代，标的是可以按需配置的\" — the system is the constant, symbols are the variable\n- **Test immediately, don't schedule**: VAN questioned why Tiger test was deferred to market open. Test NOW, not later.\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Session startup, memory restore from 2026-05-25 and 2026-05-26\n- [x] Pre-market analysis of Xiaomi 01810: daily=turning (shock_exhaustion divergence 60%), ZS [31.20,32.94], price 30.00 below ZS\n- [x] 30-min analysis: unknown state, ZS [30.14,30.60], no divergence\n- [x] Launched `xiaomi_paper_trader.py --monitor` (background process, running since 09:01)\n- [x] Monitored Xiaomi through morning session: $30.02→$29.72→$30.36 (oscillating, no signals)\n- [x] Multiple auto-memory updates and session archives\n- [x] Backup sync to ai-trading-sync (commit c14f881)\n- [x] Backed up original: `xiaomi_paper_trader.py.bak_v1`\n- [x] Read full `czsc_extension.py` (v2.0 API with StructureState)\n- [x] **Fixed Direction enum bug** in `czsc_extension.py`: 17 replacements\n- [x] Post-fix verification: detected `shock_sell @ $32.88`, full analysis\n- [x] **Cognitive alignment achieved**: AI acknowledged fundamental error of \"在下跌趋势里找做多机会=逆势思维\"\n- [x] **v2.1 顺势改造完成**: Rewrote `_determine_strategy()`, `_build_entry_plan()`, `_generate_signal()`\n- [x] **止损止盈逻辑重构 (14:06)**: Logic-driven stops, not fixed percentage\n- [x] **三层止损体系上线 (14:06-14:10)**: 入场止损/结构止损/移动止损\n- [x] **实时价格修复 (14:22-14:26)**: 新增 `_get_realtime_price()`\n- [x] **历史信号入场bug修复 (14:29-14:30)**: 日线买卖点只作参考，30分钟实时信号才触发入场\n- [x] **Tiger模拟盘下单对接 (15:12-15:16)**: `execute_trade` and `execute_exit` now call `place_order_limit()`\n- [x] Monitor restarted with Tiger order execution (PID 239561)\n- [x] **Memory flush (22:38)**: Appended session events to `memory/2026-05-26.md` — US stock monitor launch, unified system architecture lesson, system status\n- [x] **Architecture principle confirmed (22:52)**: VAN: \"系统始终是统一的在不断迭代，标的是可以按需配置的\"\n- [x] **Tiger order execution bug fixes (22:52-22:57)**: \n  - Fixed `trade_client.account` → `TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT` (TradeClient has no `account` attribute)\n  - Fixed `create_order()` missing `contract` parameter — added `trade_client.get_contract(symbol)` \n  - Fixed `get_open_orders()` — Order uses `o.contract.symbol` not `o.symbol`\n  - Fixed `cancel_order()` — requires `trade_client.cancel_order(TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT, order_id)` (account + order_id)\n- [x] **Full Tiger order flow tested (22:57)**: Place → Query → Cancel → Verify cleared — all passing\n- [x] **Tiger client fixes committed and pushed**: `b129d1a0` on main\n- [x] **Unified engine v2.0 rewritten with full xiaomi logic (22:57-23:00)**: \n  - Three-layer stops (入场止损/结构止损/移动止损)\n  - Trend-following strategy (下跌找卖点做空, 上升找买点做多)\n  - Multi-level resonance (日线→30min→5min)\n  - Real-time price acquisition (Finnhub US + Tiger HK)\n  - Historical signals don't trigger entry\n  - Risk controls (daily loss limit, consecutive loss circuit breaker)\n  - Tiger order execution via `place_order_limit()`\n- [x] **Unified engine tested**: `--list` (01810 HK + CRCL US), `--analyze 01810` ($29.76), `--analyze CRCL` ($107.21)\n- [x] **Unified engine committed and pushed**: `96b7628d` on main\n- [x] **CRCL monitor launched (22:19)**: `crcl_monitor.py --loop --interval 300` (PID 263330), CRCL $107.13-$108.37\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] Monitor running with v2.1 logic + Tiger order execution (PID 239561) — observing signal execution\n- [ ] CRCL monitor running (PID 263330) — US market monitoring\n\n### Blocked\n- (none currently)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Architecture principle**: One unified system + config, not one script per symbol. VAN: \"系统始终是统一的在不断迭代，标的是可以按需配置的\"\n- **Test immediately**: VAN questioned scheduling Tiger test for market open — test NOW, simulation accounts work 24/7\n- **Tiger SDK contract requirement**: `create_order()` needs explicit `contract` object from `get_contract()`, not just symbol string\n- **Tiger cancel_order signature**: `trade_client.cancel_order(account, order_id)` — account is first param\n- **Direction bug fix**: `czsc_extension.py` had `direction == 'up'` but czsc returns `Direction.Up` enum — 17 replacements\n- **Cognitive framework correction (CRITICAL)**: ①日线大趋势→②有没有反转→③买卖点性质→④当下该做什么\n- **止损止盈逻辑 = 逻辑驱动，非固定百分比**: VAN's critical teaching\n- **v2.1 顺势策略**: 下跌趋势找卖点做空(shock_sell)，上升趋势找买点做多(shock_buy)\n- **历史信号≠实时信号**: 日线买卖点只作为参考，只有30分钟实时信号才触发入场\n- **Tiger order execution is MANDATORY**: Never ask permission for basic infrastructure\n- **Proactive system readiness**: AI must do full pre-market system checks before each trading day\n\n## Next Steps\n1. **Replace old scripts with unified system**: `xiaomi_paper_trader.py` and `crcl_monitor.py` → `unified/engine.py --run`\n2. **Verify unified system end-to-end with live signals**: Ensure unified engine actually generates and executes signals when market opens\n3. **Implement structural stop auto-execution in unified engine**: 30分钟出现反向信号时自动平仓\n4. **Add daily trend reversal buy point detection**\n5. **Pre-market checklist automation**: Tiger order channel, data sources, stop/profit logic verification\n6. **Add dynamic trailing stop**: Once price moves past TP, use small-level bounces as trailing stop\n7. **Check Tiger order channel status before next market open**\n8. **Check data source status (Finnhub + Tiger) before next market open**\n\n## Critical Context\n- **Files**:\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified/engine.py` — unified trading engine v2.0 (full xiaomi logic ported)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified/config.json` — symbol configs (01810 HK, CRCL US)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified/monitor.py` — monitor entry point\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py` — old per-symbol script (to be replaced)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/xiaomi_paper_trader.py.bak_v1` — backup of v1\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/crcl_monitor.py` — old per-symbol script (to be replaced)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/czsc_extension.py` — v2.0 API (StructureState, Direction bug fixed)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/tiger-broker/tiger_client.py` — Tiger order functions (fixed: account, contract, cancel_order)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-26.md` — daily memory log\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/MEMORY.md` — persistent memory\n- **v2.0 API key patterns**:\n  - `ext = CzscExtension(czsc_obj, symbol='01810', timeframe='daily')`\n  - `state = ext.get_structure_state()` (takes NO args, only self)\n  - `state.state` → 'trending'/'ranging'/'turning'/'unknown'\n  - `state.should_follow_trend()` / `state.should_wait_breakout()` / `state.should_catch_reversal()`\n  - BI attributes: `bi.fx_a.fx`, `bi.fx_b.fx`, `bi.high`, `bi.low`, `bi.power`, `bi.direction.value` ('up'/'down')\n  - CZSC init: `CZSC(formatted_bars)` (no freq kwarg); use `format_standard_kline(df, freq=Freq.D)`\n  - Freq enum: `Freq.D`, `Freq.F30`, `Freq.F5` (NOT `Freq.M30`)\n- **Tiger SDK key fixes**:\n  - `trade_client.account` does NOT exist — use `TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT` env var directly\n  - `create_order()` requires `contract` param — get via `trade_client.get_contract(symbol)`\n  - `cancel_order()` signature: `trade_client.cancel_order(account, order_id)` — account is first param\n  - `Order` object: use `o.contract.symbol` not `o.symbol`\n  - `get_briefs(['01810'])` returns QuoteBrief objects; `trade_client.place_order(order)` for execution\n  - `get_managed_accounts()` returns AccountProfile list (PAPER + STANDARD)\n- **Tiger accounts**: Sim: `21409378833585169` (PAPER), Live: `1406653` (STANDARD)\n- **Monitor processes**: Xiaomi PID 239561 (nimble-kelp), CRCL PID 263330\n- **Current prices**: Xiaomi ~$29.76 (HK closed), CRCL ~$107.13 (US market)\n- **Current position**: NO POSITION\n- **Correct Xiaomi 缠论 analysis**: Daily downtrend from 61.45, second daily ZS forming, 04-30 buy = consolidation divergence bounce NOT reversal\n- **Git**: pushed to `xianfanhuang/hermes-skills.git` main branch (latest: `96b7628d`)\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nA scheduled auto-memory reminder triggered at 2026-05-26 23:01 (GMT+8), requesting: run `bash /workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/auto-memory.sh`, the