{"type":"message","id":"5542c00e","parentId":"62ffb12b","timestamp":"2026-05-26T16:35:24.724Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is pointing out several issues:\n\n1. After the test order was filled (CRCL BUY 1@107.0), I should have immediately closed the position (SELL to close)\n2. Limit orders and market orders should both be tested separately\n3. I should have configured dedicated test symbols for each market that are: low price, low volatility, high liquidity, low cost of slippage\n\nThese are all valid points. Let me address each one and fix the situation.\n\nFirst, let me check if there's still an open position in CRCL.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain说得对，三个问题：\n\n1. 成交后应立即平仓\n2. 限价单+市价单都要测\n3. 应配置专用测试品种\n\n先平掉CRCL持仓："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f8a2db54a8a34eea92179991","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /workspace/projects/workspace && python3 -c \"\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, 'skills/tiger-broker')\nfrom tiger_client import trade_client, TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT\n\n# 查持仓\nprint('=== 当前持仓 ===')\npositions = trade_client.get_positions(account=TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT)\nfor p in positions:\n    if p.quantity > 0:\n        print(f'  {p.contract.symbol}: {p.quantity}股 均价{p.average_cost}')\n\n# 平仓CRCL\nprint('\\n=== 平仓CRCL ===')\ncontract = trade_client.get_contract('CRCL')\norder = trade_client.create_order(\n    account=TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT,\n    contract=contract,\n    action='SELL',\n    order_type='MKT',\n    quantity=1\n)\ntrade_client.place_order(order)\nprint(f'平仓订单: {order.id}')\n\nimport time\ntime.sleep(5)\n\n# 验证\nprint('\\n=== 验证 ===')\npositions = trade_client.get_positions(account=TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT)\nfor p in positions:\n    if p.quantity > 0:\n        print(f'  {p.contract.symbol}: {p.quantity}股')\nif not any(p.quantity > 0 for p in positions):\n    print('  已清仓')\n\n# 查成交记录\norders = trade_client.get_orders(account=TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT)\nfor o in orders[:2]:\n    symbol = o.contract.symbol if o.contract else 'N/A'\n    print(f'  {o.id}: {symbol} {o.action} {o.quantity}@{o.limit_price} {o.status}')\n\" 2>&1 | tail -20","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":5272,"output":661,"cacheRead":74560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80493,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779813309427}}
