{"type":"message","id":"b2065c91","parentId":"5f5cda6d","timestamp":"2026-05-26T17:47:21.776Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants me to build a complete SOP (Standard Operating Procedure) system that covers the entire trading day from pre-market to after-hours. This is a significant system design task.\n\nLet me think about what this SOP should cover:\n\n1. **盘前 (Pre-market)**: \n   - 检查持仓\n   - 获取隔夜新闻\n   - 分析缠论结构\n   - 确定交易方向和策略\n   - 设置止损止盈\n\n2. **盘中 (Market hours)**:\n   - 实时监控\n   - 信号触发\n   - 下单执行\n   - 订单状态检查\n   - 止损止盈执行\n\n3. **盘后 (After-hours)**:\n   - 平仓检查\n   - 盈亏统计\n   - 交易记录整理\n   - 反思和优化\n\n4. **自动化运行**:\n   - Cron jobs\n   - 自动化脚本\n   - 监控和报警\n\nLet me build this SOP system.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白。构建盘前→盘中→盘后全流程自动化SOP："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2df97f6518c24f7bafec1d11","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# 交易SOP - 自动化运行体系\n\n## 🎯 目标\n盘前→盘中→盘后全流程自动化，一个系统统一运行\n\n---\n\n## 📋 流程概览\n\n```\n盘前 (08:00-09:30)\n  ├─ 持仓检查\n  ├─ 缠论分析\n  ├─ 策略确定\n  └─ 止损止盈设置\n\n盘中 (09:30-16:00)\n  ├─ 实时监控 (每5分钟)\n  ├─ 信号触发\n  ├─ 下单执行\n  ├─ 订单状态检查\n  └─ 止损止盈执行\n\n盘后 (16:00-18:00)\n  ├─ 平仓检查\n  ├─ 盈亏统计\n  ├─ 交易记录整理\n  └─ 反思和优化\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 自动化运行\n\n### Cron Jobs\n- 盘前扫描: 08:00\n- 盘中监控: 每5分钟 (09:30-16:00)\n- 盘后总结: 16:30\n- 记忆更新: 每小时\n\n### 运行方式\n```bash\n# 盘前\npython3 engine.py --pre-scan\n\n# 盘中\npython3 engine.py --run --interval 300\n\n# 盘后\npython3 engine.py --post-summary\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📊 输出格式\n\n### 盘前分析\n```\n=== 盘前分析 ===\n01810 小米\n趋势: ⬇️ 下跌趋势\n策略: trend_follow_short\n止损: 30.50\n止盈: 28.80\n```\n\n### 盘中信号\n```\n01810 卖出 6000 2026-05-27 HK 小米 29.75 10:15:30\n```\n\n### 盘后总结\n```\n=== 盘后总结 ===\n今日交易: 2笔\n盈亏: +$150.00\n胜率: 100%\n```\n\n---\n\n*v1.0 - 2026-05-27*\n","file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified/SOP.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":424,"output":1015,"cacheRead":76672,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78111,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779817620005}}
