{"type":"message","id":"816df663","parentId":"fcb18f48","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:08:57.403Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_337dabf6468c4bc88d2762b1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- ✅ 安装 Trading Skills 矩阵 (9 个技能)\n- ✅ 设置用户名为 Captain\n### 已安装的交易技能\n1. Trading - 技术分析\n2. Auto Trading Strategy - 自动化策略\n5. Trading Signal - 交易信号\n- Captain = 投资人/董事长\n- 决策权 = Captain\n- [ ] 确认 Captain 的风险偏好\n- ✅ 更新所有交易文件：portfolio.json / trading_log.md / 信号文件 / 每日扫描记录"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":8,"aggregated":"- ✅ 安装 Trading Skills 矩阵 (9 个技能)\n- ✅ 设置用户名为 Captain\n### 已安装的交易技能\n1. Trading - 技术分析\n2. Auto Trading Strategy - 自动化策略\n5. Trading Signal - 交易信号\n- Captain = 投资人/董事长\n- 决策权 = Captain\n- [ ] 确认 Captain 的风险偏好\n- ✅ 更新所有交易文件：portfolio.json / trading_log.md / 信号文件 / 每日扫描记录","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779818937401}}
{"type":"message","id":"31d54b9e","parentId":"816df663","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:09:13.383Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. I can still search compressed files using zcat + grep. Let me think about the optimal solution:\n\n1. **Current approach**: Compress files older than 30 days into .gz format\n   - Pros: Saves space\n   - Cons: Harder to search\n\n2. **Better approach**: Keep searchable index + decompress on-the-fly\n   - Use `zcat | grep` for searching\n   - Or use OpenClaw's memory search with proper embedding model\n\n3. **Optimal approach**: Vector database for semantic search\n   - Index all memory files (compressed or not)\n   - Use embeddings for semantic search\n   - Decompress on-the-fly when needed\n\nLet me explain this to VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好问题。当前方案的问题：\n\n**现状**：压缩成.gz → 搜索时需要解压\n```bash\nzcat archive/2026-03-23.md.gz | grep \"关键词\"\n```\n\n**hermes-sync中央仓库做法**：Git本身就是版本控制，不需要压缩\n\n**最优方案**：\n\n1. **短期**：搜索时自动解压\n```bash\n# 搜索所有记忆（包括压缩的）\nfind memory/ -name \"*.md\" -exec grep -l \"关键词\" {} \\;\nfind memory/ -name \"*.md.gz\" -exec zgrep -l \"关键词\" {} \\;\n```\n\n2. **中期**：OpenClaw Memory Search（已配置但未启用）\n- 需要embedding模型（如OpenAI/Cohere）\n- 自动索引所有.md文件（包括压缩的）\n- 语义搜索，不需要关键词匹配\n\n3. **长期**：向量数据库\n- 所有记忆文件向量化\n- 语义搜索\n- 自动解压+检索\n\n**建议**：先用方案1（自动解压搜索），等OpenClaw Memory Search配好embedding模型后用方案2。\n\n要我把搜索脚本改一下，支持自动解压搜索吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":260,"output":573,"cacheRead":88000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":88833,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779818937405}}
