{"type":"message","id":"707a1b77","parentId":"6dfa241b","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:13:46.771Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me give VAN the summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"搞定。搜索脚本已支持自动解压：\n\n```bash\nbash scripts/memory-search.sh \"缠论\"\n```\n\n输出：\n```\n【普通文件】\n  📄 memory/2026-05-27.md\n      36: - 关注品种: CRCL（缠论主力标的）...\n\n【压缩文件】\n  📦 memory/archive/2026-03-23.md.gz\n      9: - ✅ 设置用户名为 Captain...\n```\n\n普通文件和压缩文件都能搜。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":160,"output":141,"cacheRead":91008,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91309,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779819199569}}
{"type":"message","id":"24043e25","parentId":"707a1b77","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:14:20.921Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e6a61092ca0c2dcd5ffe10617e\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-27 02:14 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e6a61092ca0c2dcd5ffe10617e]\nVAN: 中仓库做的方案与向量数据库方案比较"}],"timestamp":1779819260917}}
{"type":"message","id":"635aec41","parentId":"24043e25","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:14:33.921Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants me to compare the hermes-sync central repository approach with the vector database approach for memory search.\n\nLet me think about the differences:\n\n**hermes-sync中央仓库做法**:\n- Git版本控制\n- 文件直接存储（.md格式）\n- 用grep/git log搜索\n- 简单可靠，但搜索能力有限\n\n**向量数据库方案**:\n- 语义搜索（不需要关键词匹配）\n- 支持模糊查询\n- 需要embedding模型\n- 更复杂，需要维护\n\nLet me create a comparison table.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"| 维度 | hermes-sync中央仓库 | 向量数据库 |\n|------|-------------------|-----------|\n| **存储** | Git直接存.md文件 | 向量化后存DB |\n| **搜索方式** | grep/关键词匹配 | 语义搜索 |\n| **搜索能力** | 精确匹配，需要知道关键词 | 模糊匹配，自然语言查询 |\n| **压缩** | 不需要（Git管理） | 需要向量化 |\n| **维护成本** | 低（Git自动） | 高（需要embedding模型） |\n| **查询速度** | 快（文件系统） | 快（向量索引） |\n| **准确性** | 高（精确匹配） | 中（语义相似度） |\n| **适用场景** | 知道要找什么 | 不知道具体关键词 |\n\n**举例**：\n- 查询\"缠论\"：两个方案都能找到\n- 查询\"之前讨论的交易策略\"：向量数据库能语义匹配，grep找不到\n\n**结论**：\n- **短期**：hermes-sync方案够用（grep + 自动解压）\n- **长期**：向量数据库更好（语义搜索，不需要记住关键词）\n\n建议：先用hermes-sync方案，等OpenClaw Memory Search配好embedding模型后切换。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":435,"output":517,"cacheRead":91136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":92088,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779819260920}}
{"type":"message","id":"f5e0f0db","parentId":"635aec41","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:18:21.327Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e6a70077ca0c4d9a48745397fd\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-05-27 02:18 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e6a70077ca0c4d9a48745397fd]\nVAN: 向量数据库的话适配不知道具体关键词的场景同时也能更好满足知道关键词的场景是不"}],"timestamp":1779819501323}}
{"type":"message","id":"72ad5646","parentId":"f5e0f0db","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:18:28.747Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking if vector database can handle both scenarios - when you don't know the exact keywords AND when you do know the keywords. The answer is yes, vector database can handle both cases.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"对。向量数据库两种场景都更好：\n\n| 场景 | grep | 向量数据库 |\n|------|------|-----------|\n| 知道关键词\"缠论\" | ✅ 精确匹配 | ✅ 语义匹配+精确匹配 |\n| 不知道关键词\"之前讨论的交易策略\" | ❌ 找不到 | ✅ 语义匹配 |\n| 模糊查询\"风控相关\" | ❌ 需要猜关键词 | ✅ 直接语义搜索 |\n\n向量数据库 = 语义搜索 + 关键词搜索，两种能力都有。\n\n结论：长期方案用向量数据库是最优解。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":743,"output":223,"cacheRead":91520,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":92486,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779819501326}}
