{"type":"message","id":"bf2b2684","parentId":"c34af7d9","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:24:39.522Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see. OpenClaw has a memory search system that uses:\n1. SQLite for storage (FTS5 for full-text search)\n2. Vector embeddings (optional, requires API key for OpenAI/Google/Voyage/Mistral)\n3. QMD (Quantized Memory Database) for vector search\n\nThe current setup has no embedding provider configured, so it's only using FTS (full-text search).\n\nLet me explain this to VAN.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"OpenClaw v2026.3.13 的方案：\n\n**架构**：\n- SQLite FTS5（全文搜索）+ 向量嵌入（可选）\n- 支持 QMD（Quantized Memory Database）向量搜索\n- 支持 Gemini/OpenAI/Voyage/Mistral embedding\n\n**当前状态**：\n```\nProvider: none (未配置embedding)\nFTS: ready (全文搜索可用)\nVector: unknown (向量搜索未启用)\nIndexed: 0/44 files\n```\n\n**配置embedding后**：\n- 自动索引所有.md文件\n- 语义搜索 + 关键词搜索\n- 支持压缩文件自动解压\n\n**需要**：配置embedding API key（OpenAI/Google等）\n\nOpenClaw方案 = 向量数据库方案，已经内置了。只需要配置API key就能启用。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":659,"output":375,"cacheRead":95552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":96586,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779819869193}}
