{"type":"message","id":"3c7e8653","parentId":"73343ef0","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:28:17.104Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_701c222d875548919ea033f6","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When using a custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint,\nset `memorySearch.remote.apiKey` (and optional `memorySearch.remote.headers`).\n\n### QMD backend (experimental)\n\nSet `memory.backend = \"qmd\"` to swap the built-in SQLite indexer for\n[QMD](https://github.com/tobi/qmd): a local-first search sidecar that combines\nBM25 + vectors + reranking. Markdown stays the source of truth; OpenClaw shells\nout to QMD for retrieval. Key points:\n\n**Prereqs**\n\n- Disabled by default. Opt in per-config (`memory.backend = \"qmd\"`).\n- Install the QMD CLI separately (`bun install -g https://github.com/tobi/qmd` or grab\n  a release) and make sure the `qmd` binary is on the gateway’s `PATH`.\n- QMD needs an SQLite build that allows extensions (`brew install sqlite` on\n  macOS).\n- QMD runs fully locally via Bun + `node-llama-cpp` and auto-downloads GGUF\n  models from HuggingFace on first use (no separate Ollama daemon required).\n- The gateway runs QMD in a self-contained XDG home under\n  `~/.openclaw/agents/<agentId>/qmd/` by setting `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` and\n--\nIf you want to use a **custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint** (OpenRouter, vLLM, or a proxy),\nyou can use the `remote` configuration with the OpenAI provider:\n\n```json5\nagents: {\n  defaults: {\n    memorySearch: {\n      provider: \"openai\","}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":9,"aggregated":"When using a custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint,\nset `memorySearch.remote.apiKey` (and optional `memorySearch.remote.headers`).\n\n### QMD backend (experimental)\n\nSet `memory.backend = \"qmd\"` to swap the built-in SQLite indexer for\n[QMD](https://github.com/tobi/qmd): a local-first search sidecar that combines\nBM25 + vectors + reranking. Markdown stays the source of truth; OpenClaw shells\nout to QMD for retrieval. Key points:\n\n**Prereqs**\n\n- Disabled by default. Opt in per-config (`memory.backend = \"qmd\"`).\n- Install the QMD CLI separately (`bun install -g https://github.com/tobi/qmd` or grab\n  a release) and make sure the `qmd` binary is on the gateway’s `PATH`.\n- QMD needs an SQLite build that allows extensions (`brew install sqlite` on\n  macOS).\n- QMD runs fully locally via Bun + `node-llama-cpp` and auto-downloads GGUF\n  models from HuggingFace on first use (no separate Ollama daemon required).\n- The gateway runs QMD in a self-contained XDG home under\n  `~/.openclaw/agents/<agentId>/qmd/` by setting `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` and\n--\nIf you want to use a **custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint** (OpenRouter, vLLM, or a proxy),\nyou can use the `remote` configuration with the OpenAI provider:\n\n```json5\nagents: {\n  defaults: {\n    memorySearch: {\n      provider: \"openai\",","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779820097102}}
{"type":"message","id":"02d1b60b","parentId":"3c7e8653","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:28:38.837Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the situation. MiMo is an OpenAI-compatible API, but it's a chat/completion model, not an embedding model. OpenClaw's memory search needs an embedding provider - it supports:\n\n1. `openai` - needs OpenAI key\n2. `gemini` - needs Gemini key  \n3. `voyage` - needs Voyage key\n4. `mistral` - needs Mistral key\n5. `ollama` - local\n6. `local` - node-llama-cpp\n7. Custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint via `memorySearch.remote`\n\nThe key question: Does MiMo's API (`https://token-plan-sgp.xiaomimimo.com/v1`) support the `/v1/embeddings` endpoint? MiMo is primarily a chat model provider. It may not offer embedding models.\n\nLet me check if there's a way to use a free/cheap embedding provider. Actually, the simplest solution would be to use Ollama locally for embeddings, or check if MiMo has embedding endpoints.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain，MiMo provider 主要是**聊天模型**（mimo-v2.5-pro等），不是 embedding 模型。\n\nOpenClaw memory search 需要的是 **embedding 模型**（向量嵌入），支持的provider：\n\n| Provider | 需要 |\n|----------|------|\n| OpenAI | OpenAI API key |\n| Gemini | Gemini API key |\n| Voyage | Voyage API key |\n| Mistral | Mistral API key |\n| Ollama | 本地Ollama，免费 |\n| local | node-llama-cpp，免费 |\n\n**最省方案**：用 Ollama 本地跑 embedding，免费，不需要额外API key。\n\n要试试配 Ollama 吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":87002,"output":591,"cacheRead":32768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":120361,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779820097108}}
{"type":"compaction","id":"454e5d44","parentId":"02d1b60b","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:29:46.193Z","summary":"## Goal\n1. Prepare for and monitor Hong Kong stock market (HK) Asian trading session, specifically Xiaomi 01810\n2. **Rewrite core trading analysis logic** to align with correct 缠论 (Chanlun) cognitive framework: **大级别定方向，小级别找机会** (macro level determines direction, micro level finds opportunities)\n3. Upgrade `xiaomi_paper_trader.py` to integrate intelligent level v2.0 with correct trend-first analysis\n4. **Ensure all trading infrastructure is production-ready before market open** — Tiger order execution, stop/take-profit logic, real-time data source\n5. **Build unified trading system** — one engine, configurable symbols, not one script per symbol\n6. **Standardize order record format** to match Tiger APP display format\n7. **Build automated trading SOP** — full workflow from pre-market to after-hours\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Max single trade loss: 2% (default) / 3% (current code uses 3%)\n- VAN's core principle: \"凡强趋必然浅回调，不论多空\" (strong trends always have shallow pullbacks)\n- Smooth fluent trends = small timeframe level = main target\n- System must use StructureState-driven level selection\n- Trading assistant persona: 🦞 Trading Assistant\n- **VAN要求**: 每次汇报必须带具体参数（价格/中枢/笔/背驰/流畅度），不要模板式报告\n- **核心认知原则**: 先判趋势再找机会，顺势而为。下跌趋势中做空才是顺势，做多是逆势\n- **止损止盈核心原则**: 止损 = 入场逻辑已破坏的止损；止盈 = 持仓逻辑破坏的止损。不是固定百分比，而是逻辑驱动\n- **VAN's frustration**: AI must proactively ensure infrastructure readiness — not wait for Captain to point out missing integrations\n- **Bug honesty principle**: When VAN points out a bug, admit it directly (\"Captain指出，已修复\") — don't repackage as \"已修正\"\n- **Architecture principle (22:52)**: \"系统始终是统一的在不断迭代，标的是可以按需配置的\" — the system is the constant, symbols are the variable\n- **Test immediately, don't schedule**: VAN questioned why Tiger test was deferred to market open. Test NOW, not later.\n- **Build it, use it immediately**: VAN: 建好了就应该立即用，不要等明天\n- **订单记录格式**: 对齐老虎APP单行格式，优先用实际成交价(avg_fill_price)，价格保留两位小数\n- **测试完必须平仓**: 测试流程必须是 买入→撤单→平仓→清仓，不能留持仓\n- **下单前必须查持仓**: 不要盲目下卖单，先查持仓状态（CRCL空头事故教训）\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Session startup, memory restore from 2026-05-25 and 2026-05-26\n- [x] Pre-market analysis of Xiaomi 01810: daily=turning (shock_exhaustion divergence 60%), ZS [31.20,32.94], price 30.00 below ZS\n- [x] 30-min analysis: unknown state, ZS [30.14,30.60], no divergence\n- [x] Launched `xiaomi_paper_trader.py --monitor` (background process, running since 09:01)\n- [x] Monitored Xiaomi through morning session: $30.02→$29.72→$30.36 (oscillating, no signals)\n- [x] Multiple auto-memory updates and session archives\n- [x] Backup sync to ai-trading-sync (commit c14f881)\n- [x] Backed up original: `xiaomi_paper_trader.py.bak_v1`\n- [x] Read full `czsc_extension.py` (v2.0 API with StructureState)\n- [x] **Fixed Direction enum bug** in `czsc_extension.py`: 17 replacements\n- [x] Post-fix verification: detected `shock_sell @ $32.88`, full analysis\n- [x] **Cognitive alignment achieved**: AI acknowledged fundamental error of \"在下跌趋势里找做多机会=逆势思维\"\n- [x] **v2.1 顺势改造完成**: Rewrote `_determine_strategy()`, `_build_entry_plan()`, `_generate_signal()`\n- [x] **止损止盈逻辑重构 (14:06)**: Logic-driven stops, not fixed percentage\n- [x] **三层止损体系上线 (14:06-14:10)**: 入场止损/结构止损/移动止损\n- [x] **实时价格修复 (14:22-14:26)**: 新增 `_get_realtime_price()`\n- [x] **历史信号入场bug修复 (14:29-14:30)**: 日线买卖点只作参考，30分钟实时信号才触发入场\n- [x] **Tiger模拟盘下单对接 (15:12-15:16)**: `execute_trade` and `execute_exit` now call `place_order_limit()`\n- [x] Monitor restarted with Tiger order execution (PID 239561)\n- [x] **Architecture principle confirmed (22:52)**: VAN: \"系统始终是统一的在不断迭代，标的是可以按需配置的\"\n- [x] **Tiger order execution bug fixes (22:52-22:57)**: Fixed `trade_client.account` → `TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT`, `create_order()` contract param, `get_open_orders()` symbol access, `cancel_order()` signature\n- [x] **Full Tiger order flow tested (22:57)**: Place → Query → Cancel → Verify cleared — all passing\n- [x] **Tiger client fixes committed and pushed**: `b129d1a0` on main\n- [x] **Unified engine v2.0 rewritten with full xiaomi logic (22:57-23:00)**: Three-layer stops, trend-following, multi-level resonance, real-time price, historical signal filter, risk controls, Tiger order execution\n- [x] **Unified engine tested**: `--list` (01810 HK + CRCL US), `--analyze 01810` ($29.76), `--analyze CRCL` ($107.21)\n- [x] **Unified engine committed and pushed**: `96b7628d` on main\n- [x] **CRCL monitor launched (22:19)**: `crcl_monitor.py --loop --interval 300` (PID 263330)\n- [x] **Unified engine v2.1: 3个NoneType bug修复 (23:18-23:30)**: `_check_resonance`, `_build_exit_plan`, `_build_entry_plan` — all fixed for daily=None case\n- [x] **New methods added**: `analyze_with_czsc()` (calls czsc library for full analysis), `_fetch_bars()` (Tiger for HK, Finnhub for US)\n- [x] **Old monitors stopped, unified engine launched**: `engine.py --run --interval 300` (PID 266613)\n- [x] **下单测试成交 (23:58-00:00)**: Market order test: failed (non-trading hours for HK), `OrderType` enum not JSON serializable (use string 'MKT'/'LMT' instead)\n- [x] **Dedicated test symbols configured**: HK → 01024 (快手-W, $45.8); US → NIO (蔚来, $5.24) — low-price, high-liquidity\n- [x] **Test orders executed (00:37-00:38)**: 01024 BUY 100@45.00→HELD+cancelled; NIO BUY 10@5.20→HELD+cancelled; 01024 BUY 100@46.00→HELD+cancelled; NIO BUY 10@5.30→HELD+cancelled\n- [x] **CRCL空头事故 (00:44-00:46)**: Blind SELL caused -1 share short, fixed by BUY to cover. Lesson: always check positions before trading\n- [x] **统一引擎交易记录新增 (00:46-01:10)**: `_save_trades()` + `_load_trades()`, entry/exit format output, saves to `trades.json`\n- [x] **订单记录格式标准化 (01:10-01:43)**: Multiple iterations to match Tiger APP format\n  - Initial: `NIO 买入 10 2026-05-27 US 蔚来 5.25 01:31:41` (one line, wrong price)\n  - Fixed price: Use `avg_fill_price` not `limit_price` for filled orders\n  - Fixed rounding: `round(price, 2)` → 5.2193 becomes 5.22\n  - Two-line format tried → VAN said \"不用两行，就这样\" → reverted to single line\n  - Final format: `NIO 买入 10 2026-05-27 US 蔚来 5.22 01:31:41`\n- [x] **get_order_records() final implementation**: `skills/tiger-broker/tiger_client.py` — price优先用`avg_fill_price`(when >0), 否则`limit_price`, `round(price, 2)`, single-line format with stock name\n- [x] **测试单平仓 (01:42)**: VAN pointed out test order wasn't closed. NIO BUY 10 → SELL 10 at 5.24. Verified 无持仓\n- [x] **交易SOP自动化体系 (01:46-01:50)**: Created `sop.py` with pre-scan, monitor, post-summary, full-cycle modes\n  - `sop.py --pre-scan`: 持仓检查 + 缠论分析 + 策略确定 + 信号生成\n  - `sop.py --monitor`: 实时监控 + 信号触发 + 下单执行\n  - `sop.py --post-summary`: 平仓检查 + 盈亏统计 + 订单记录 + 风控状态\n  - `sop.py --full`: 完整周期（盘前→盘中→盘后）\n- [x] **SOP bug fix**: `generate_signal()` requires `(symbol, analysis)` not just `(analysis)`\n- [x] **SOP.md created**: `chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified/SOP.md` — flow diagram and output format spec\n- [x] **每日记忆归档 (02:00)**: `memory-archive.sh` compressed `2026-03-23.md` → `archive/2026-03-23.md.gz`\n- [x] **Session归档 (02:04)**: `2026-05-26-feishu-current.md` archived\n- [x] **记忆搜索脚本 (02:11)**: `scripts/memory-search.sh` — supports auto-decompression of .md.gz files via `zgrep`\n- [x] **记忆搜索方案讨论**: Compared hermes-sync Git approach vs vector database vs OpenClaw built-in Memory Search\n- [x] **OpenClaw Memory Search status checked**: Provider=none, FTS=ready, Vector=unknown, 0/44 files indexed. Needs embedding API key (OpenAI/Google/Voyage/Mistral)\n\n### In Progress\n- [ ] Unified engine running (PID 266613) with 01810 + CRCL — monitoring for signals during market hours\n- [ ] Configure OpenClaw Memory Search embedding provider for semantic search\n\n### Blocked\n- (none currently)\n\n## Key Decisions\n- **Architecture principle**: One unified system + config, not one script per symbol. VAN: \"系统始终是统一的在不断迭代，标的是可以按需配置的\"\n- **Test immediately**: VAN questioned scheduling Tiger test for market open — test NOW, simulation accounts work 24/7\n- **Use immediately**: VAN: 建好了就应该立即用，不要等明天 — unified engine activated same night\n- **Tiger SDK contract requirement**: `create_order()` needs explicit `contract` object from `get_contract()`, not just symbol string\n- **Tiger cancel_order signature**: `trade_client.cancel_order(account, order_id)` — account is first param\n- **Direction bug fix**: `czsc_extension.py` had `direction == 'up'` but czsc returns `Direction.Up` enum — 17 replacements\n- **Cognitive framework correction (CRITICAL)**: ①日线大趋势→②有没有反转→③买卖点性质→④当下该做什么\n- **止损止盈逻辑 = 逻辑驱动，非固定百分比**: VAN's critical teaching\n- **v2.1 顺势策略**: 下跌趋势找卖点做空(shock_sell)，上升趋势找买点做多(shock_buy)\n- **历史信号≠实时信号**: 日线买卖点只作为参考，只有30分钟实时信号才触发入场\n- **Tiger order execution is MANDATORY**: Never ask permission for basic infrastructure\n- **Proactive system readiness**: AI must do full pre-market system checks before each trading day\n- **`place_order_limit` parameter order**: `(symbol, price, quantity, action)` — tested and confirmed via actual order placement\n- **OrderType enum issue**: Tiger SDK `OrderType` enum not JSON serializable — use string 'MKT'/'LMT' instead\n- **港股非交易时段**: Orders go to HELD status, won't fill until market opens; US stocks can fill during US trading hours\n- **订单记录格式定稿**: 单行格式，优先用avg_fill_price，round(price,2)，包含股票名称\n- **记忆搜索长期方案**: 向量数据库 > hermes-sync Git方案 > grep搜索。向量DB两种场景（知道/不知道关键词）都更好\n- **OpenClaw内置方案**: Memory Search已内置SQLite FTS5 + 向量嵌入支持(QMD)，只需配置embedding API key即可启用\n\n## Next Steps\n1. **Monitor unified engine during HK market open (09:30 HKT)**: Verify signal generation and order execution with live market\n2. **Configure OpenClaw Memory Search**: Add embedding API key (OpenAI/Google) to enable semantic memory search\n3. **Implement structural stop auto-execution in unified engine**: 30分钟出现反向信号时自动平仓\n4. **Add daily trend reversal buy point detection**\n5. **Pre-market checklist automation**: Tiger order channel, data sources, stop/profit logic verification\n6. **Add dynamic trailing stop**: Once price moves past TP, use small-level bounces as trailing stop\n7. **Remove old scripts**: Clean up `xiaomi_paper_trader.py` and `crcl_monitor.py` references once unified engine proven stable\n8. **Wire SOP into cron/scheduler**: Auto-run `sop.py --pre-scan` at 08:00, `--monitor` every 5min during market, `--post-summary` at 16:30\n\n## Critical Context\n- **Files**:\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified/engine.py` — unified trading engine v2.1 (full xiaomi logic + NoneType fixes + czsc integration)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified/config.json` — symbol configs (01810 HK, CRCL US, test_symbols: 01024 HK + NIO US)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified/monitor.py` — monitor entry point\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified/sop.py` — **NEW**: SOP automation runner (pre-scan, monitor, post-summary, full-cycle)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/chanlun-agent/paper-trading/unified/SOP.md` — **NEW**: SOP flow diagram and spec\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/skills/tiger-broker/tiger_client.py` — Tiger order functions + `get_order_records()` (单行格式, avg_fill_price优先, round 2位)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/scripts/memory-search.sh` — **NEW**: Memory search with auto-decompression of .md.gz\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/archive/2026-03-23.md.gz` — first archived memory (system setup day)\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/2026-05-27.md` — daily memory log\n  - `/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/sessions/` — session archives\n- **v2.0 API key patterns**:\n  - `ext = CzscExtension(czsc_obj, symbol='01810', timeframe='daily')`\n  - `state = ext.get_structure_state()` (takes NO args, only self)\n  - `state.state` → 'trending'/'ranging'/'turning'/'unknown'\n  - `state.should_follow_trend()` / `state.should_wait_breakout()` / `state.should_catch_reversal()`\n  - BI attributes: `bi.fx_a.fx`, `bi.fx_b.fx`, `bi.high`, `bi.low`, `bi.power`, `bi.direction.value` ('up'/'down')\n  - CZSC init: `CZSC(formatted_bars)` (no freq kwarg); use `format_standard_kline(df, freq=Freq.D)`\n  - Freq enum: `Freq.D`, `Freq.F30`, `Freq.F5` (NOT `Freq.M30`)\n- **Tiger SDK key fixes**:\n  - `trade_client.account` does NOT exist — use `TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT` env var directly\n  - `create_order()` requires `contract` param — get via `trade_client.get_contract(symbol)`\n  - `cancel_order()` signature: `trade_client.cancel_order(account, order_id)` — account is first param\n  - `Order` object: use `o.contract.symbol` not `o.symbol`\n  - `get_open_orders()` returns formatted string — use `trade_client.get_orders(account=TIGER_SIM_ACCOUNT)` for order objects\n  - `trade_client.get_fills()` does NOT exist on TradeClient\n  - `OrderType` enum not JSON serializable — use string 'MKT'/'LMT'\n  - `get_briefs(['01810'])` returns QuoteBrief objects; `trade_client.place_order(order)` for execution\n  - `get_managed_accounts()` returns AccountProfile list (PAPER + STANDARD)\n- **Tiger accounts**: Sim: `21409378833585169` (PAPER), Live: `1406653` (STANDARD)\n- **Monitor processes**: Unified engine PID 266613 (tidal-valley), old Xiaomi PID stopped, old CRCL PID stopped\n- **Current prices**: Xiaomi ~$29.76 (HK closed), CRCL ~$106.98 (US market), NIO ~$5.22, 01024 ~$45.8\n- **Current position**: 无持仓 (all test positions closed)\n- **Correct Xiaomi 缠论 analysis**: Daily downtrend from 61.45, second daily ZS forming, 04-30 buy = consolidation divergence bounce NOT reversal\n- **Git**: pushed to `xianfanhuang/hermes-skills.git` main branch (latest: `c4268528`)\n- **OpenClaw Memory Search**: Provider=none, FTS=ready, Store=`/workspace/projects/memory/main.sqlite`, 0/44 files indexed, needs embedding API key\n- **Stock name mapping in get_order_records()**: NIO→蔚来, CRCL→Circle, 01810→小米, 01024→快手\n\n---\n\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\n\n## Original Request\nVAN asked whether an API configured for a MiMo provider could also be used (for some purpose related to the assistant's setup/configuration).\n\n## Early Progress\n- No substantive technical work was done yet; this appears to be the opening message of a conversation.\n\n## Context for Suffix\n- VAN is asking about API compatibility/configuration with a \"MiMo provider\" — this likely relates to setting up or configuring an AI model provider API for use in some tool or system. The suffix presumably contains the assistant's response and any subsequent technical discussion or setup work.","firstKeptEntryId":"58156847","tokensBefore":120361,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":false}
