{"type":"message","id":"5e526f26","parentId":"f59eed6e","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:33:33.002Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the ai-trading-sync repo exists and has recent syncs. Now let me explain the current architecture to VAN and how the \"打通\" (connecting) works.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Captain，当前架构是这样的：\n\n## 🔗 当前连接方式\n\n```\n本地 Workspace (hermes-skills.git)\n    ↓ 每6小时自动同步\nai-trading-sync.git (GitHub 私有仓库)\n```\n\n**已有4个自动化cron**:\n| 任务 | 频率 | 功能 |\n|------|------|------|\n| auto-memory | 每小时 | 更新今日记忆 |\n| session-archive | 每2小时 | 归档session |\n| backup-sync | 每6小时 | 同步到ai-trading-sync |\n| memory-archive | 每天02:00 | 压缩30天前记忆 |\n\n## 📊 当前状态\n\n**ai-trading-sync 最新**: `2ede209` (今天02:33)\n- 记忆 ✅\n- 交易代码 ✅\n- 知识库 ✅\n\n## 🤔 你说的\"打通\"是指？\n\n1. **多设备同步**？ → ai-trading-sync 已实现，新设备 `restore.sh` 即可恢复\n2. **云端记忆搜索**？ → 需要配embedding provider（Ollama/Gemini）\n3. **其他渠道共享记忆**？ → Kimi/微信 都读同一个 MEMORY.md\n4. **实时同步**（不是6小时）？ → 可以改成 git hook 实时push\n\n具体想打通什么？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":733,"output":387,"cacheRead":69120,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70240,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779820402578}}
