{"type":"message","id":"4fa33af7","parentId":"f08088d4","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:42:38.982Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So there are two types of session data:\n1. `/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/sessions/` - archived session summaries (small, readable .md files)\n2. `/workspace/projects/agents/main/sessions/` - raw JSONL session transcripts (27MB, full conversation logs)\n\nVAN is right - the raw session transcripts are not searchable. Let me check if OpenClaw's memory search indexes session transcripts.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5eb7a9328b994af78afa0fa3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /workspace/projects/agents/main/sessions/*.jsonl 2>/dev/null | wc -l && echo \"files\" && du -sh /workspace/projects/agents/main/sessions/*.jsonl 2>/dev/null | tail -5"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1663,"output":244,"cacheRead":72000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73907,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779820952398}}
