{"type":"message","id":"61ca427f","parentId":"e415a0d2","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:58:17.678Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_58fcd2f2e39640179ef4dc36","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Usage: qmd search [options] <query>\n===\nqmd — Quick Markdown Search\n\nUsage:\n  qmd <command> [options]\n\nPrimary commands:\n  qmd query <query>             - Hybrid search with auto expansion + reranking (recommended)\n  qmd query 'lex:..\\nvec:...'   - Structured query document (you provide lex/vec/hyde lines)\n  qmd search <query>            - Full-text BM25 keywords (no LLM)\n  qmd vsearch <query>           - Vector similarity only\n  qmd get <file>[:line] [-l N]  - Show a single document, optional line slice\n  qmd multi-get <pattern>       - Batch fetch via glob or comma-separated list\n  qmd skills list/get/path      - List and retrieve bundled runtime skills\n  qmd skill show/install        - Show or install the QMD skill\n  qmd mcp                       - Start the MCP server (stdio transport for AI agents)\n  qmd bench <fixture.json>      - Run search quality benchmarks against a fixture file\n\nCollections & context:\n  qmd collection add/list/remove/rename/show   - Manage indexed folders\n  qmd context add/list/rm                      - Attach human-written summaries"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":198,"aggregated":"Usage: qmd search [options] <query>\n===\nqmd — Quick Markdown Search\n\nUsage:\n  qmd <command> [options]\n\nPrimary commands:\n  qmd query <query>             - Hybrid search with auto expansion + reranking (recommended)\n  qmd query 'lex:..\\nvec:...'   - Structured query document (you provide lex/vec/hyde lines)\n  qmd search <query>            - Full-text BM25 keywords (no LLM)\n  qmd vsearch <query>           - Vector similarity only\n  qmd get <file>[:line] [-l N]  - Show a single document, optional line slice\n  qmd multi-get <pattern>       - Batch fetch via glob or comma-separated list\n  qmd skills list/get/path      - List and retrieve bundled runtime skills\n  qmd skill show/install        - Show or install the QMD skill\n  qmd mcp                       - Start the MCP server (stdio transport for AI agents)\n  qmd bench <fixture.json>      - Run search quality benchmarks against a fixture file\n\nCollections & context:\n  qmd collection add/list/remove/rename/show   - Manage indexed folders\n  qmd context add/list/rm                      - Attach human-written summaries","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779821897674}}
