{"type":"message","id":"8548eb21","parentId":"3eada913","timestamp":"2026-05-26T18:59:48.505Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_a62213763d5245709ec65b41","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"qmd — Quick Markdown Search\n\nUsage:\n  qmd <command> [options]\n\nPrimary commands:\n  qmd query <query>             - Hybrid search with auto expansion + reranking (recommended)\n  qmd query 'lex:..\\nvec:...'   - Structured query document (you provide lex/vec/hyde lines)\n  qmd search <query>            - Full-text BM25 keywords (no LLM)\n  qmd vsearch <query>           - Vector similarity only\n  qmd get <file>[:line] [-l N]  - Show a single document, optional line slice\n  qmd multi-get <pattern>       - Batch fetch via glob or comma-separated list\n  qmd skills list/get/path      - List and retrieve bundled runtime skills\n  qmd skill show/install        - Show or install the QMD skill\n  qmd mcp                       - Start the MCP server (stdio transport for AI agents)\n  qmd bench <fixture.json>      - Run search quality benchmarks against a fixture file\n\nCollections & context:\n  qmd collection add/list/remove/rename/show   - Manage indexed folders\n  qmd context add/list/rm                      - Attach human-written summaries\n===\n00fca770-a2e4-4bfe-9c93-d9aad8ce2a49.jsonl.reset.2026-04-01T22-10-42.774Z\n06016557-da59-4b12-bd23-dc5adffce2da.jsonl.reset.2026-03-23T23-43-22.383Z\n09d20d81-114a-4e1c-81a2-05e7b8ea34f1.jsonl.reset.2026-05-17T10-36-49.239Z\n0aba196e-fbe1-47d6-afa7-d73b4d202b59.jsonl.reset.2026-04-11T21-25-15.492Z\n123ede45-2963-4a25-b7c1-08ef5fee147e.jsonl.reset.2026-04-25T21-28-58.344Z"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":102,"aggregated":"qmd — Quick Markdown Search\n\nUsage:\n  qmd <command> [options]\n\nPrimary commands:\n  qmd query <query>             - Hybrid search with auto expansion + reranking (recommended)\n  qmd query 'lex:..\\nvec:...'   - Structured query document (you provide lex/vec/hyde lines)\n  qmd search <query>            - Full-text BM25 keywords (no LLM)\n  qmd vsearch <query>           - Vector similarity only\n  qmd get <file>[:line] [-l N]  - Show a single document, optional line slice\n  qmd multi-get <pattern>       - Batch fetch via glob or comma-separated list\n  qmd skills list/get/path      - List and retrieve bundled runtime skills\n  qmd skill show/install        - Show or install the QMD skill\n  qmd mcp                       - Start the MCP server (stdio transport for AI agents)\n  qmd bench <fixture.json>      - Run search quality benchmarks against a fixture file\n\nCollections & context:\n  qmd collection add/list/remove/rename/show   - Manage indexed folders\n  qmd context add/list/rm                      - Attach human-written summaries\n===\n00fca770-a2e4-4bfe-9c93-d9aad8ce2a49.jsonl.reset.2026-04-01T22-10-42.774Z\n06016557-da59-4b12-bd23-dc5adffce2da.jsonl.reset.2026-03-23T23-43-22.383Z\n09d20d81-114a-4e1c-81a2-05e7b8ea34f1.jsonl.reset.2026-05-17T10-36-49.239Z\n0aba196e-fbe1-47d6-afa7-d73b4d202b59.jsonl.reset.2026-04-11T21-25-15.492Z\n123ede45-2963-4a25-b7c1-08ef5fee147e.jsonl.reset.2026-04-25T21-28-58.344Z","cwd":"/workspace/projects/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779821988503}}
