{"type":"message","id":"3b02effd","parentId":"3e896a39","timestamp":"2026-05-26T19:18:04.150Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The batch embedding keeps failing. The issue is that Ollama works for single queries (via curl) but OpenClaw's batch process keeps failing. Let me try a different approach:\n\n1. Try using `memorySearch.provider = \"openai\"` with a custom baseUrl pointing to Ollama's OpenAI-compatible endpoint\n2. Or try `memorySearch.remote` with Ollama's endpoint\n3. Or try setting up `models.providers.ollama` properly\n\nActually, let me the OpenClaw docs say about the Ollama provider configuration. The issue might be that OpenClaw's Ollama integration needs specific configuration that we don't have.\n\nActually, from the earlier doc search: \"memorySearch.provider = 'ollama'\" is supported. But maybe it needs `models.providers.ollama.baseUrl` configured too?\n\nLet me try configuring ollama as a model provider first.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"The batch keeps failing. Let me try configuring Ollama as a model provider first, which might help OpenClaw find the endpoint."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7882360fe7fa4df88fe3284c","name":"gateway","arguments":{"action":"config.schema.lookup","path":"models.providers.ollama"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":347,"output":435,"cacheRead":110464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":111246,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779823073296}}
{"type":"message","id":"56e6615c","parentId":"3b02effd","timestamp":"2026-05-26T19:18:04.175Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7882360fe7fa4df88fe3284c","toolName":"gateway","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"result\": {\n    \"path\": \"models.providers.ollama\",\n    \"schema\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false\n    },\n    \"children\": [\n      {\n        \"key\": \"baseUrl\",\n        \"path\": \"models.providers.ollama.baseUrl\",\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"required\": true,\n        \"hasChildren\": false,\n        \"hint\": {\n          \"label\": \"Model Provider Base URL\",\n          \"help\": \"Base URL for the provider endpoint used to serve model requests for that provider entry. Use HTTPS endpoints and keep URLs environment-specific through config templating where needed.\",\n          \"tags\": [\n            \"models\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"hintPath\": \"models.providers.*.baseUrl\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"key\": \"apiKey\",\n        \"path\": \"models.providers.ollama.apiKey\",\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"hasChildren\": false,\n        \"hint\": {\n          \"label\": \"Model Provider API Key\",\n          \"help\": \"Provider credential used for API-key based authentication when the provider requires direct key auth. Use secret/env substitution and avoid storing real keys in committed config files.\",\n          \"tags\": [\n            \"security\",\n            \"auth\",\n            \"models\"\n          ],\n          \"sensitive\": true\n        },\n        \"hintPath\": \"models.providers.*.apiKey\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"key\": \"auth\",\n        \"path\": \"models.providers.ollama.auth\",\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"hasChildren\": false,\n        \"hint\": {\n          \"label\": \"Model Provider Auth Mode\",\n          \"help\": \"Selects provider auth style: \\\"api-key\\\" for API key auth, \\\